,"Verwaltung von Frontmatter, Bildern und Taxonomie-Einträgen","Erstellung von Git-Branches","Integration mit dem Autoren- und Kategorien-Verzeichnis","Schema-Quelle der Wahrheit in src/content.config.ts"],"pt":["Adiciona novos posts ao site ZenML","Lida com frontmatter, imagens e entradas de taxonomia","Suporta fluxos de trabalho de fonte","Manipula branches do Git","Utiliza src/content.config.ts como fonte de verdade"],"ru":["Добавляет новые посты на сайт ZenML","Обрабатывает frontmatter, изображения и записи таксономии","Поддерживает источники рабочих процессов","Манипулирует ветками Git","Использует src/content.config.ts в качестве источника правды"],"ar":["يضيف منشورات جديدة إلى موقع ZenML","يتولى معالجة البيانات الوصفية، والصور، ومدخلات التصنيف","يدعم سير عمل المصدر","يتلاعب بفروع الجيت","يستخدم src/content.config.ts كمرجع للصحة"]},"keywords":{"en":["how to use blog-post-contributor","blog-post-contributor setup guide","automated blog posting with ZenML","blog-post-contributor vs manual blogging","what is blog-post-contributor","blog-post-contributor install and configuration"],"zh":["AIエージェント博客文章贡献者","博客文章创建工具","frontmatter处理","images处理","taxonomy entries处理","git分支处理","src/content.config.ts","博客内容目录","作者目录","分类目录","标签目录"],"ja":["AIエージェントブログ投稿コントリビューター","ブログ投稿作成ツール","frontmatter処理","画像処理","taxonomyエントリ処理","Gitブランチ処理","src/content.config.ts","ブログコンテンツディレクトリ","著者ディレクトリ","カテゴリディレクトリ","タグディレクトリ"],"ko":["AI 에이전트 블로그 게시물 기여자","블로그 게시물 생성 도구","frontmatter 처리","이미지 처리","분류 항목 처리","Git 분기 처리","src/content.config.ts","블로그 콘텐츠 디렉토리","저자 디렉토리","분류 디렉토리","태그 디렉토리"],"es":["contribuyente de publicaciones de blog","ZenML","sitio web","contenidos","frontmatter","imágenes","taxonomía","Git","autoren","categorías"],"fr":["contributeur de billets de blog","ZenML","site web","contenus","frontmatter","images","taxonomie","Git","auteurs","catégories"],"de":["Blog-Beitrag-Mitwirkender","ZenML","Website","Inhalte","Frontmatter","Bilder","Taxonomie","Git","Autoren","Kategorien"],"pt":["Blog Post Contributor","ZenML","frontmatter","imagens","entradas de taxonomia","fluxos de trabalho de fonte","branches do Git","src/content.config.ts"],"ru":["ИИ Агент Blog Post Contributor","ZenML","frontmatter","изображения","записи таксономии","источники рабочих процессов","ветки Git","src/content.config.ts"],"ar":["مساهم المنشورات على المدونة","ZenML","البيانات الوصفية","الصور","مدخلات التصنيف","سير عمل المصدر","فروع الجيت","src/content.config.ts"]}},"owner":"zenml-io","repo":"zenml-io-v2","repoPath":"zenml-io/zenml-io-v2","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-06T16:58:36Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"blog-post-contributor","description":">-","bodyPreview":"# Blog Post Contributor\n\nAdd a new blog post to the ZenML website (`src/content/blog/`). This skill supports two source workflows and handles all the plumbing: frontmatter, images, taxonomy entries, and git branching.\n\n## Quick Reference\n\n| Item | Value |\n|------|-------|\n| Blog content dir | `src/content/blog/` |\n| Authors dir | `src/content/authors/` |\n| Categories dir | `src/content/categories/` |\n| Tags dir | `src/content/tags/` |\n| Schema source of truth | `src/content.config.ts` (`blogSche","body":"# Blog Post Contributor\n\nAdd a new blog post to the ZenML website (`src/content/blog/`). This skill supports two source workflows and handles all the plumbing: frontmatter, images, taxonomy entries, and git branching.\n\n## Quick Reference\n\n| Item | Value |\n|------|-------|\n| Blog content dir | `src/content/blog/` |\n| Authors dir | `src/content/authors/` |\n| Categories dir | `src/content/categories/` |\n| Tags dir | `src/content/tags/` |\n| Schema source of truth | `src/content.config.ts` (`blogSchema`) |\n| Image upload skill | `r2-image-upload` |\n| Image compression skill | `avif-image-compressor` |\n\n## Step 0: Create a Feature Branch\n\nBefore any work, create a feature branch:\n\n```bash\ngit checkout -b blog/<slug>\n```\n\nUse the blog post''s slug as the branch name suffix (e.g., `blog/my-new-post-title`).\n\n## Choose Your Path\n\nAsk the user: **\"Do you have a local markdown file, or is the content in Notion?\"**\n\n- **Path A**: [From Markdown File](#path-a-from-markdown-file) — user already has a `.md` file\n- **Path B**: [From Notion Export](#path-b-from-notion-export) — content lives in Notion, needs exporting\n\n---\n\n## Path A: From Markdown File\n\n### A1. Read the provided markdown file\n\nRead the user''s `.md` file. Identify:\n- The title (from H1 or frontmatter)\n- Any existing frontmatter (may need reformatting)\n- Inline images (relative paths, URLs, or base64)\n- The main body content\n\n### A2. Generate the slug\n\nDerive the slug from the title:\n- Lowercase, hyphen-separated, no special characters\n- Keep it concise but descriptive (e.g., `introducing-zenml-pipelines`)\n- Confirm the slug with the user\n\n### A3. Skip to [Common Steps](#common-steps-both-paths)\n\n---\n\n## Path B: From Notion Export\n\n**Do NOT use the Notion MCP server** to fetch blog content. Notion''s MCP returns block-level JSON that loses formatting nuance, and Notion-hosted images use temporary CDN URLs that expire. Instead, have the user prepare two things manually:\n\n### B1. Ask the user to export from Notion\n\nThe user should:\n1. **Export the page as Markdown** from Notion (⋯ menu → Export → Markdown & CSV)\n2. **Save all images manually** into a separate folder, **in the order they appear in the page** (top to bottom). This order matters because the Notion markdown export uses generic filenames like `image1.png`, `image2.png` — matching them to the right placeholder depends on save order.\n\n**Ask the user for:**\n- The path to the exported `.md` file (or the Notion page link for reference context)\n- The path to the folder containing the saved images\n\n> **Tip for the user:** Open the Notion page, right-click each image from top to bottom, and \"Save Image As...\" into one folder. The file modification timestamps will preserve insertion order. Alternatively, the Notion markdown export includes images in a subfolder with matching filenames — if the user provides the full Notion export zip, the images will already be mapped.\n\n### B2. Read the exported markdown\n\nRead the `.md` file. Notion exports typically include:\n- A first H1 that is the page title (sometimes duplicated)\n- Metadata lines at the top (keyword, slug, meta description) if the author added them\n- Image references as `![](FolderName/imageN.png)` relative paths\n- Tables, bullet lists, code blocks — usually valid markdown\n\nClean up:\n- Remove any Notion metadata lines (keyword, slug, meta description) from the top — these go into frontmatter instead\n- **Remove ALL H1 headers (`# ...`) from the body.** The title lives in frontmatter and `BlogLayout` renders it — any H1 in the markdown body creates a duplicate heading on the page. The body should start directly with prose or an H2.\n- Strip Notion-specific formatting artifacts if any\n\n### B3. Map images to their placeholders\n\nThe markdown will contain image references like `![](E2B%20alternatives/image17.png)`. Match each reference to the corresponding file in the user''s image folder by filename. If filenames match directly (common with Notion exports), the mapping is straightforward.\n\nIf the filenames don''t match, use file modification timestamps (earliest saved = first image in the post) to establish the correct order.\n\n### B4. Generate the slug\n\nSame as A2 — derive from title, confirm with user.\n\n### B5. Continue to [Common Steps](#common-steps-both-paths)\n\n---\n\n## Common Steps (Both Paths)\n\n### C1. Process images in the markdown body\n\nScan the markdown for any image references that are NOT already R2 URLs:\n- Local file paths → convert to AVIF + upload to R2\n- External URLs (non-R2) → download, convert to AVIF, upload to R2\n- Already on R2 (`https://assets.zenml.io/...` or `pub-*.r2.dev`) → keep as-is\n\nFor the hero/main image:\n1. Ask the user which image should be the hero image (or if they have one)\n2. Convert and upload it to R2 with `--prefix content/blog`\n3. Note the URL for the `mainImage` frontmatter field\n\n### C2. Validate or create the author\n\nCheck if the author exists in `src/content/authors/`:\n\n```bash\nls src/content/authors/\n```\n\n**If the author exists:** Use their slug (filename without `.md`).\n\n**If the author is new:** Create `src/content/authors/<author-slug>.md`:\n\n```yaml\n---\nname: \"Author Full Name\"\nslug: \"author-slug\"\nbio: \"Short author bio\"\n# avatar, email, linkedin are all optional\n---\n```\n\nAsk the user for the author''s name and any optional fields.\n\n### C3. Validate or create tags\n\nCheck if each tag exists in `src/content/tags/`:\n\n```bash\nls src/content/tags/\n```\n\n**If a tag is new**, create `src/content/tags/<tag-slug>.md`:\n\n```yaml\n---\nname: \"Tag Display Name\"\nslug: \"tag-slug\"\n---\n```\n\nExisting tags (118 total) cover most topics. Check before creating duplicates.\nCommon tags: `mlops`, `llmops`, `zenml`, `genai`, `agents`, `tutorials`, `best-practices`, `cloud`, `open-source`, `pipelines`.\n\n### C4. Validate the category\n\nCategories are a fixed set (14 total). List them for the user to choose:\n\n| Slug | Name |\n|------|------|\n| `mlops` | MLOps |\n| `zenml` | ZenML |\n| `llmops` | LLMOps |\n| `llms` | LLMs |\n| `tutorials` | Tutorials |\n| `community` | Community |\n| `case-studies` | Case Studies |\n| `newsletters` | Newsletters |\n| `podcast` | Podcast |\n| `sales-blog` | Sales Blog |\n| `tech-startup` | Tech Startup |\n| `webinars` | Webinars |\n| `zenml-updates` | ZenML Updates |\n| `mlstacks` | MLStacks |\n\nCategory is optional. Don''t create new categories — use the closest match.\n\n### C5. Build the frontmatter\n\nAssemble the complete frontmatter block:\n\n```yaml\n---\ntitle: \"Your Blog Post Title\"\nslug: \"your-blog-post-slug\"\ndraft: false\nauthor: \"author-slug\"\ncategory: \"mlops\"\ntags:\n  - \"zenml\"\n  - \"mlops\"\ndate: \"2026-02-26T00:00:00.000Z\"\nreadingTime: \"X mins\"\nmainImage:\n  url: \"https://assets.zenml.io/content/blog/xxxxxxxx/hero.avif\"\n  alt: \"Description of the hero image\"\nseo:\n  title: \"Your Blog Post Title - ZenML Blog\"\n  description: \"A concise 150-160 character description for search engines and social sharing.\"\n  canonical: \"https://www.zenml.io/blog/your-blog-post-slug\"\n  ogImage: \"https://assets.zenml.io/content/blog/xxxxxxxx/hero.avif\"\n---\n```\n\n**Key rules:**\n- `slug` MUST match the filename (e.g., `your-blog-post-slug.md`)\n- `date` should be an ISO 8601 string\n- `readingTime` format: `\"X mins\"` — estimate ~200 words/minute\n- `mainImage.url` must be an absolute URL (R2-hosted)\n- `seo.canonical` must be `https://www.zenml.io/blog/<slug>`\n- `draft: false` by default — only set `true` if the user specifically wants a draft\n- `webflow` field is NOT needed for new native posts\n\n### C6. Write the blog post file\n\n**Token efficiency**: When the user provides a ready `.md` file, do NOT rewrite it through the Write tool (which outputs all content tokens). Instead, use bash: write the frontmatter to the target file with a heredoc, then `cat` the body (with H1 and metadata lines stripped via `tail -n +N`) and append with `>>`. This avoids duplicating thousands of tokens.\n\nSave to `src/content/blog/<slug>.md`:\n\n```bash\n# The file path must match the slug\nsrc/content/blog/your-blog-post-slug.md\n```\n\n**Important:** The markdown body must NOT contain an H1 (`# Title`). The title is rendered by `BlogLayout` from the frontmatter `title` field. The body should begin with prose or an H2 (`## ...`). Including an H1 creates a duplicate heading on the page.\n\n### C7. Validate\n\nRun the validation checks:\n\n```bash\n# Content schema validation\npnpm validate:content\n\n# TypeScript check\npnpm check\n\n# Full build (run in background, check tail for success)\npnpm build\n```\n\nFix any issues that arise. Common problems:\n- Slug mismatch between frontmatter and filename\n- Tag/author slug not found (forgot to create the `.md` file)\n- Image URL not absolute (must start with `https://`)\n- Invalid date format\n\n### C8. Commit and push\n\n```bash\ngit add src/content/blog/<slug>.md\n# Also add any new author/tag files\ngit add src/content/authors/<new-author>.md\ngit add src/content/tags/<new-tag>.md\ngit commit -m \"Add blog post: <title>\"\ngit push -u origin blog/<slug>\n```\n\n### C9. Summarize for the user\n\nPrint a summary:\n- Blog post file path\n- Branch name\n- Slug and URL it will live at: `https://www.zenml.io/blog/<slug>`\n- Hero image URL (if set)\n- Any new tags/authors created\n- Whether the post is published (`draft: false`) or draft (`draft: true`)\n- Reminder: create a PR for review\n\n## Frontmatter Field Reference\n\n| Field | Required | Type | Example |\n|-------|----------|------|---------|\n| `title` | Yes | string | `\"My Great Post\"` |\n| `slug` | Yes | string | `\"my-great-post\"` |\n| `draft` | No | boolean | `false` (set `true` only if user wants a draft) |\n| `featured` | No | boolean | `false` (default: `false`) |\n| `author` | Yes | slug ref | `\"hamza-tahir\"` |\n| `category` | No | slug ref | `\"mlops\"` |\n| `tags` | No | slug ref[] | `[\"zenml\", \"mlops\"]` |\n| `date` | Yes | ISO date | `\"2026-02-26T00:00:00.000Z\"` |\n| `readingTime` | No | string | `\"5 mins\"` |\n| `mainImage.url` | No* | absolute URL | `\"https://assets.zenml.io/...\"` |\n| `mainImage.alt` | No | string | `\"Pipeline diagram\"` |\n| `seo.title` | No | string | `\"Title - ZenML Blog\"` |\n| `seo.description` | No | string | `\"150-char description\"` |\n| `seo.canonical` | No | absolute URL | `\"https://www.zenml.io/blog/slug\"` |\n| `seo.ogImage` | No | absolute URL | Same as mainImage.url |\n\n*`mainImage` is technically optional but strongly recommended for social sharing and the blog listing page.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-07T03:54:30.283Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Content Creation Agents needing streamlined blog post automation with frontmatter, images, and taxonomy entries.","zh":"非常适合需要简化博客文章自动化的内容创作代理，包括前置内容、图像和分类条目。","ja":"コンテンツ作成エージェントがブログ投稿の自動化をストリームライン化する必要がある場合に最適です。フロントマター、画像、タクソノミー エントリが含まれます。","ko":"컨텐츠 생성 에이전트가 블로그 게시물 자동화를 간소화해야 하는 경우에 적합합니다. 프론트매터, 이미지 및 택소노미 항목이 포함됩니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de creación de contenido que necesitan una automatización de publicaciones de blog simplificada con frontmatter, imágenes y entradas de taxonomía.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de création de contenu qui ont besoin d''une automatisation de publication de blog simplifiée avec frontmatter, images et entrées de taxonomie.","de":"Perfekt für Content Creation Agents, die eine vereinfachte Automatisierung von Blog-Beiträgen mit Frontmatter, Bildern und Taxonomieeinträgen benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Criação de Conteúdo que precisam de automação de postagens de blog simplificada com frontmatter, imagens e entradas de taxonomia.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов по созданию контента, которым требуется упрощенная автоматизация создания постов в блоге с помощью frontmatter, изображений и записей таксономии.","ar":"مثالي لعميل إنشاء المحتوى الذين يحتاجون إلى تحسين تلقائي لإنشاء منشورات المدونة مع frontmatter والصور والمدخلات الضريبية."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to automate blog post creation on the ZenML website, handling git branching, frontmatter, images, and taxonomy entries using directories like src/content/blog/, src/content/authors/, and schema source of truth from src/content.config.ts.","zh":"赋予代理人在 ZenML 网站上自动创建博客帖子的能力，处理 git 分支、前置内容、图像和分类条目，使用 src/content/blog/、src/content/authors/ 等目录和来自 src/content.config.ts 的模式源。","ja":"エージェントが ZenML Web サイトでブログ投稿の自動化を実行できるようにし、Git ブランチング、フロントマター、画像、タクソノミー エントリを処理し、src/content/blog/、src/content/authors/ などのディレクトリと src/content.config.ts からのスキーマのソースオブトゥルースを使用します。","ko":"에이전트가 ZenML 웹 사이트에서 블로그 게시물 자동화를 수행할 수 있도록 하여 Git 분기, 프론트 매터, 이미지 및 택소노미 항목을 처리하고 src/content/blog/, src/content/authors/ 등의 디렉토리 및 src/content.config.ts의 스키마 소스를 사용합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes automatizar la creación de publicaciones de blog en el sitio web de ZenML, manejar ramas de git, frontmatter, imágenes y entradas de taxonomía usando directorios como src/content/blog/, src/content/authors/ y fuente de verdad del esquema desde src/content.config.ts.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''automatiser la création de publications de blog sur le site Web de ZenML, en gérant les branches Git, le frontmatter, les images et les entrées de taxonomie en utilisant des répertoires tels que src/content/blog/, src/content/authors/ et la source de vérité du schéma depuis src/content.config.ts.","de":"Ermöglicht es den Agents, die Erstellung von Blog-Beiträgen auf der ZenML-Website zu automatisieren, Git-Branching, Frontmatter, Bilder und Taxonomieeinträge zu verwalten, indem Verzeichnisse wie src/content/blog/, src/content/authors/ und die Quelle der Wahrheit des Schemas von src/content.config.ts verwendet werden.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a automatizar a criação de postagens de blog no site ZenML, lidando com ramificação git, frontmatter, imagens e entradas de taxonomia usando diretórios como src/content/blog/, src/content/authors/ e esquema de fonte de verdade de src/content.config.ts.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью автоматизировать создание постов в блоге на сайте ZenML, обрабатывая ветвление git, frontmatter, изображения и записи таксономии, используя директории, такие как src/content/blog/, src/content/authors/ и схему источника правды из src/content.config.ts.","ar":"يمكن العميل من تلقين إنشاء منشورات المدونة على موقع ZenML، وتحديد فروع git و frontmatter والصور والمدخلات الضريبية باستخدام المجلدات مثل src/content/blog/ و src/content/authors/ ومصدر مخطط الحقيقة من src/content.config.ts."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating blog post creation with pre-configured frontmatter and images","Generating taxonomy entries for categorization and tagging","Streamlining content creation with git branching for version control"],"zh":["使用预配置的前置内容和图像自动化博客文章创建","为分类和标记生成分类条目","使用 Git 分支进行版本控制来简化内容创建"],"ja":["事前設定されたフロントマターと画像でブログ投稿の自動化を実行する","カテゴリ化とタグ付けのためのタクソノミー エントリを生成する","バージョン管理のために Git ブランチングを使用してコンテンツ作成をストリームライン化する"],"ko":["사전 구성된 프론트 매터와 이미지로 블로그 게시물 자동화를 수행하는 것","분류 및 태그 지정의 택소노미 항목을 생성하는 것","버전 제어를 위해 Git 분기를 사용하여 컨텐츠 생성을 간소화하는 것"],"es":["Automatizar la creación de publicaciones de blog con frontmatter y imágenes preconfigurados","Generar entradas de taxonomía para categorización y etiquetado","Simplificar la creación de contenido con ramas de git para el control de versiones"],"fr":["Automatiser la création de publications de blog avec frontmatter et images préconfigurés","Générer des entrées de taxonomie pour la catégorisation et le marquage","Simplifier la création de contenu avec des branches Git pour le contrôle de version"],"de":["Automatisieren der Erstellung von Blog-Beiträgen mit vorkonfiguriertem Frontmatter und Bildern","Generieren von Taxonomieeinträgen für Kategorisierung und Tagging","Vereinfachen der Content-Erstellung mit Git-Branching für die Versionskontrolle"],"pt":["Automatizar a criação de postagens de blog com frontmatter e imagens pré-configurados","Gerar entradas de taxonomia para categorização e marcação","Simplificar a criação de conteúdo com ramificação git para controle de versão"],"ru":["Автоматизировать создание постов в блоге с предварительно настроенным frontmatter и изображениями","Генерировать записи таксономии для категоризации и тегирования","Упрощать создание контента с помощью ветвления git для контроля версий"],"ar":["توفير إنشاء منشورات المدونة مع frontmatter والصور مسبقًا","إنشاء مدخلات ضريبية للتصنيف والوسم","تسهيل إنشاء المحتوى باستخدام فروع git لمراقبة الإصدارات"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires access to ZenML website and its directory structure","Limited to handling specific file formats and directories (e.g., src/content/blog/, src/content.config.ts)"],"zh":["需要访问 ZenML 网站及其目录结构","仅限处理特定文件格式和目录（例如 src/content/blog/、src/content.config.ts）"],"ja":["ZenML Web サイトとそのディレクトリ構造へのアクセスが必要","特定のファイル形式とディレクトリ（例：src/content/blog/、src/content.config.ts）のみを処理可能"],"ko":["ZenML 웹 사이트 및 그 디렉토리 구조에 대한 액세스가 필요합니다.","특정 파일 형식 및 디렉토리(예: src/content/blog/, src/content.config.ts)만 처리할 수 있음"],"es":["Requiere acceso al sitio web de ZenML y a su estructura de directorios","Limitado a manejar formatos de archivo y directorios específicos (por ejemplo, src/content/blog/, src/content.config.ts)"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès au site Web de ZenML et à sa structure de répertoires","Limité à la gestion de formats de fichiers et de répertoires spécifiques (par exemple, src/content/blog/, src/content.config.ts)"],"de":["Erfordert Zugriff auf die ZenML-Website und ihre Verzeichnisstruktur","Begrenzt auf die Verwaltung spezifischer Dateiformate und Verzeichnisse (z.B. src/content/blog/, src/content.config.ts)"],"pt":["Requer acesso ao site ZenML e à sua estrutura de diretórios","Limitado ao gerenciamento de formatos de arquivo e diretórios específicos (por exemplo, src/content/blog/, src/content.config.ts)"],"ru":["Требует доступа к сайту ZenML и его структуре директорий","Ограничен обработкойเฉพาะ форматов файлов и директорий (например, src/content/blog/, src/content.config.ts)"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى موقع ZenML وهيكل المجلدات","محدود بمعالجة تنسيقات الملفات والمجلدات المحددة (على سبيل المثال src/content/blog/ و src/content.config.ts)"]},"version":4},"contentHash":"47c4be434394b9b28dd32fd13674817756168505d738417d6e87158123f0f55c","qualityScore":39}');
