ion qui automatise la fusion de branches et le nettoyage des flux de travail","de":"Close-build ist eine Funktion, die die Zusammenführung von Branches und die Bereinigung von Workflows automatisiert","pt":"O que é Close-Build? É uma ferramenta de automação de merge e limpeza no LifeOS Programme.","ru":"Что такое Close-Build? Это инструмент автоматизации слияния и очистки в LifeOS Programme.","ar":"ما هو Close-Build؟ هو أداة تلقيم الدمج والتنظيف في برنامج LifeOS"},"features":{"en":["Runs squash merge to main via python3 scripts/workflow/close_build.py","Performs local cleanup, including branch deletion and active context clearing","Utilizes PreToolUse hooks, such as .claude/hooks/close-build-gate.sh, for automated closure tests and doc stewardship","Supports dry run mode for testing closure gates without committing changes","Automates targeted closure tests and doc stewardship, eliminating manual invocation"],"zh":["自动化构建关闭","squash 合并到 main 分支","本地清理（分支删除 + 活动上下文清除）","PreToolUse hook 自动运行","支持 Python 3"],"ja":["自動化されたビルドの終了","squash マージ to main ブランチ","ローカルのクリーンアップ（ブランチの削除 + アクティブなコンテキストのクリア）","PreToolUse hook の自動実行","Python 3 のサポート"],"ko":["자동화된 빌드 종료","squash 병합到 main 브랜치","로컬 클린업（브랜치 삭제 + 액티브 컨텍스트 클리어）","PreToolUse hook 자동 실행","Python 3 지원"],"es":["Squash merge a la rama principal","Limpieza local de ramas y contexto activo","Ejecución automática de pruebas de cierre y gestión de documentación","Integración con PreToolUse hook para git merge y git push","Compatibilidad con Python y CLI"],"fr":["Fusion de squash à la branche principale","Nettoyage local des branches et du contexte actif","Exécution automatique des tests de fermeture et de la gestion de la documentation","Intégration avec le hook PreToolUse pour git merge et git push","Compatibilité avec Python et CLI"],"de":["Squash-Merge zur Hauptbranch","Lokale Bereinigung von Branches und aktuellem Kontext","Automatisierte Ausführung von Abschlusstests und Dokumentenverwaltung","Integration mit PreToolUse-Hook für git merge und git push","Kompatibilität mit Python und CLI"],"pt":["Automatização do merge para o branch main","Limpeza local de branches e contexto ativo","Uso de scripts em Python para automação","Integração com hooks de pré-uso para validação","Suporte à execução em modo seco para testes","Compatibilidade com o LifeOS Programme"],"ru":["Автоматизация слияния в ветку main","Местная очистка веток и активного контекста","Использование скриптов Python для автоматизации","Интеграция с хуками предиспользования для валидации","Поддержка выполнения в сухом режиме для тестов","Совместимость с LifeOS Programme"],"ar":["تلقيم الدمج التلقائي إلى الفرع الرئيسي","تنظيف المحلي للفروع والسياق النشط","استخدام سكريبتات Python للتلقيم","التكامل مع Hooks قبل الاستخدام للتحقق","دعم التشغيل في وضع الجاف للتحقق","التوافق مع برنامج LifeOS"]},"keywords":{"en":["how to use close-build","close-build setup guide","automated merge and cleanup","PreToolUse hooks tutorial","close-build vs git flow","close-build install","what is close-build","close-build alternative","python scripts for git automation","git repository management best practices"],"zh":["Close Build","自动化构建关闭","LifeOS","Python 3","squash 合并","PreToolUse hook","AI 工具","自动化构建"],"ja":["Close Build","自動化されたビルドの終了","LifeOS","Python 3","squash マージ","PreToolUse hook","AIエージェント","自動化されたビルド"],"ko":["Close Build","자동화된 빌드 종료","LifeOS","Python 3","squash 병합","PreToolUse hook","AI 도구","자동화된 빌드"],"es":["close-build","automatización de flujos de trabajo","Python","CLI","git merge","git push","pruebas de cierre","gestión de documentación","herramientas de desarrollo"],"fr":["close-build","automatisation des flux de travail","Python","CLI","git merge","git push","tests de fermeture","gestion de la documentation","outils de développement"],"de":["close-build","Automatisierung von Workflows","Python","CLI","git merge","git push","Abschlusstests","Dokumentenverwaltung","Entwicklungstools"],"pt":["close-build","lifeos programme","automatização de merge","limpeza de branches","scripts em python","hooks de pré-uso","desenvolvimento de software","ferramentas de automação","programação em python"],"ru":["close-build","lifeos programme","автоматизация слияния","очистка веток","скрипты python","хуки предиспользования","разработка программного обеспечения","инструменты автоматизации","программирование на python"],"ar":["close-build","برنامج lifeos","تلقيم الدمج","تنظيف الفروع","سكريبتات بايثون","Hooks قبل الاستخدام","تطوير البرمجيات","أدوات التلقيم","برمجة بايثون"]}},"owner":"marcusglee11","repo":"LifeOS","repoPath":"marcusglee11/LifeOS","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-02T21:18:45Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"close-build","description":"Use when a branch is ready to close. Closure gates (tests, doc stewardship) are enforced automatically by the PreToolUse hook on git merge/push. This skill handles merge orchestration, cleanup, and the final report.","bodyPreview":"# Close Build\n\nMerge to main and clean up. Closure gates run automatically via the PreToolUse hook.\n\n## Default behavior\n\n```bash\npython3 scripts/workflow/close_build.py\n```\n\nThis runs:\n- squash merge to `main`,\n- local cleanup (branch delete + active context clear).\n\nNote: targeted closure tests and doc stewardship are enforced by the\n`.claude/hooks/close-build-gate.sh` PreToolUse hook on `git merge`/`git push`.\nThey no longer need to be invoked manually.\n\n## Dry run (gates only)\n\n```bash\npytho","body":"# Close Build\n\nMerge to main and clean up. Closure gates run automatically via the PreToolUse hook.\n\n## Default behavior\n\n```bash\npython3 scripts/workflow/close_build.py\n```\n\nThis runs:\n- squash merge to `main`,\n- local cleanup (branch delete + active context clear).\n\nNote: targeted closure tests and doc stewardship are enforced by the\n`.claude/hooks/close-build-gate.sh` PreToolUse hook on `git merge`/`git push`.\nThey no longer need to be invoked manually.\n\n## Dry run (gates only)\n\n```bash\npython3 scripts/workflow/closure_gate.py\n```\n\nUse to check gate status without merge/cleanup. Returns JSON verdict.\n\n## No cleanup mode\n\n```bash\npython3 scripts/workflow/close_build.py --no-cleanup\n```\n\nUse when you need to keep branch/context after merge.\n\n## Git worktree constraint\n\nRun `close_build.py` (and underlying `closure_pack.py`) from the **worktree directory**, not the primary repo.\n\nWhen `main` is already checked out in the primary worktree, the script\ndetects this automatically (via `git branch --show-current` on the repo root)\nand skips the `checkout main` step. The merge proceeds against the primary\nworktree''s `main` directly.\n\nIf you accidentally run from the primary repo on a scoped branch, it hard-blocks\nwith `ISOLATION_REQUIRED`. Recover in one command:\n\n```bash\npython3 scripts/workflow/start_build.py --recover-primary\n```\n\n## Report contract (strict)\n\nOutput must use this section order:\n\n1. `Branch`\n2. `Commits`\n3. `Test Results`\n4. `What Was Done`\n5. `What Remains`\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-07T03:56:01.448Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Git Repository Agents needing automated merge and cleanup capabilities via Python scripts and PreToolUse hooks.","zh":"适用于需要通过Python脚本和PreToolUse hooks实现自动合并和清理功能的Git Repository Agents。","ja":"PythonスクリプトとPreToolUse hooksを使用して自動マージとクリーンアップ機能を必要とするGit Repository Agentsに最適。","ko":"Python 스크립트와 PreToolUse hooks를 사용하여 자동 병합 및 정리 기능을 필요한 Git Repository 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de repositorio Git que necesitan capacidades de fusión y limpieza automatizadas a través de scripts de Python y ganchos de PreToolUse.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de référentiel Git nécessitant des capacités de fusion et de nettoyage automatisées via des scripts Python et des crochets PreToolUse.","de":"Ideal für Git-Repository-Agents, die automatisierte Merge- und Cleanup-Funktionen über Python-Skripte und PreToolUse-Hooks benötigen.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Repositório Git que necessitam de capacidades de mesclagem e limpeza automatizadas via scripts Python e hooks PreToolUse.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов репозитория Git, которым необходимы автоматические возможности слияния и очистки через скрипты Python и хуки PreToolUse.","ar":"مثالية لعميل مخزن Git الذي يحتاج إلى قدرات دمج وتنظيف آلية عبر scripts Python و hooks PreToolUse."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to automate squash merges to main, local cleanup, and enforce targeted closure tests and doc stewardship using Python 3 and PreToolUse hooks like `.claude/hooks/close-build-gate.sh`.","zh":"赋予代理人使用Python 3和PreToolUse hooks（如`.claude/hooks/close-build-gate.sh`）自动执行squash合并到主分支、局部清理和强制执行目标闭合测试和文档管理的能力。","ja":"Python 3とPreToolUse hooks（例：`.claude/hooks/close-build-gate.sh`）を使用して、メインブランチへのsquashマージ、ローカルクリーニング、ターゲットクロージャーテストとドキュメント管理の強制を自動化する能力をエージェントに与える。","ko":"Python 3 및 PreToolUse hooks(.claude/hooks/close-build-gate.sh)를 사용하여 메인 브랜치로의 스쿼시 병합, 로컬 정리, 대상 폐쇄 테스트 및 문서 관리의 시행을 자동화하는 기능을 에이전트에게 부여합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a automatizar las fusiones de squash a main, la limpieza local y a aplicar pruebas de cierre y tutoría de documentos dirigidos utilizando Python 3 y ganchos de PreToolUse como `.claude/hooks/close-build-gate.sh`.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''automatiser les fusions de squash vers main, la nettoyage local et d''imposer des tests de fermeture et une tutelle de documents ciblés en utilisant Python 3 et des crochets PreToolUse comme `.claude/hooks/close-build-gate.sh`.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agents, Squash-Merges zu main, lokale Bereinigung und gezielte Abschlusstests und Dokumentenbetreuung mithilfe von Python 3 und PreToolUse-Hooks wie `.claude/hooks/close-build-gate.sh` zu automatisieren.","pt":"Concede poder aos agentes para automatizar mesclagens squash para o ramo principal, limpeza local, e impor testes de fechamento e gestão de documentos direcionados usando Python 3 e hooks PreToolUse como `.claude/hooks/close-build-gate.sh`.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью автоматизировать слияние squash в основную ветку, локальную очистку и обеспечивать целевые тесты закрытия и управление документами с помощью Python 3 и хуков PreToolUse, таких как `.claude/hooks/close-build-gate.sh`.","ar":"تمنح الوكلاء القدرة على تلقين دمج squash إلى الفرع الرئيسي والتنظيف المحلي وتطبيق اختبارات إغلاق وثائق المستهدف باستخدام Python 3 و hooks PreToolUse مثل `.claude/hooks/close-build-gate.sh`."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating merge to main and cleanup processes","Enforcing closure gates via PreToolUse hooks","Streamlining Git repository management with Python scripts"],"zh":["自动执行合并到主分支和清理流程","通过PreToolUse hooks强制执行闭合门","使用Python脚本简化Git仓库管理"],"ja":["メインブランチへのマージとクリーンアッププロセスの自動化","PreToolUse hooksを使用したクロージャーゲートの強制","Pythonスクリプトを使用したGitリポジトリ管理のストリーミング"],"ko":["메인 브랜치로의 병합 및 정리 프로세스 자동화","PreToolUse hooks를 사용한 폐쇄 게이트의 강제","Python 스크립트를 사용한 Git 리포지토리 관리의 스트리밍"],"es":["Automatizar procesos de fusión a main y limpieza","Aplicar puertas de cierre via ganchos de PreToolUse","Optimizar la administración del repositorio Git con scripts de Python"],"fr":["Automatiser les processus de fusion vers main et de nettoyage","Imposer des portes de fermeture via des crochets PreToolUse","Optimiser la gestion du référentiel Git avec des scripts Python"],"de":["Automatisierung von Merge- und Cleanup-Prozessen zu main","Durchsetzen von Abschlusstests über PreToolUse-Hooks","Optimierung der Git-Repository-Verwaltung mit Python-Skripten"],"pt":["Automatizar processos de mesclagem para o ramo principal e limpeza","Impor portões de fechamento via hooks PreToolUse","Otimizar gerenciamento de repositório Git com scripts Python"],"ru":["Автоматизация процессов слияния в основную ветку и очистки","Обеспечение закрытия шлюзов через хуки PreToolUse","Оптимизация управления репозиторием Git с помощью скриптов Python"],"ar":["تلقين عمليات الدمج إلى الفرع الرئيسي والتنظيف","تطبيق بوابات الإغلاق عبر hooks PreToolUse","تحسين إدارة مخزن Git باستخدام scripts Python"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Python 3","Git repository access needed","Specific to repositories using PreToolUse hooks"],"zh":["需要Python 3","需要Git仓库访问","特定于使用PreToolUse hooks的仓库"],"ja":["Python 3が必要","Gitリポジトリへのアクセスが必要","PreToolUse hooksを使用するリポジトリに特有"],"ko":["Python 3이 필요합니다","Git 리포지토리 액세스가 필요합니다","PreToolUse hooks를 사용하는 리포지토리에서만 작동"],"es":["Requiere Python 3","Se necesita acceso al repositorio Git","Específico para repositorios que utilizan ganchos de PreToolUse"],"fr":["Nécessite Python 3","L''accès au référentiel Git est nécessaire","Spécifique aux référentiels utilisant des crochets PreToolUse"],"de":["Benötigt Python 3","Git-Repository-Zugriff erforderlich","Spezifisch für Repositorys, die PreToolUse-Hooks verwenden"],"pt":["Requer Python 3","Acesso ao repositório Git necessário","Específico para repositórios que usam hooks PreToolUse"],"ru":["Требуется Python 3","Необходим доступ к репозиторию Git","Относится только к репозиториям, использующим хуки PreToolUse"],"ar":["يتطلب Python 3","مطلوب الوصول إلى مخزن Git","محدد لمخازن تستخدم hooks PreToolUse"]},"version":4},"contentHash":"b16067dc94546daac78ec1f294a858956459d8941e95ea340d8b1d55d88cb01d","qualityScore":39}');
