web usáveis por todos","ru":"Веб-доступность - это практика создания веб-сайтов и приложений, доступных для всех","ar":"إمكانية الوصول إلى الويب هي ممارسة جعل المواقع والتطبيقات القابلة للاستخدام من قبل الجميع"},"features":{"en":["Implements ARIA patterns for buttons with aria-pressed and aria-disabled attributes","Supports modal dialog accessibility with role=''dialog'' and aria-modal=''true''","Utilizes aria-labelledby and aria-describedby for modal dialog descriptions","Enables toggle feature with onClick event handling","Follows WCAG 2.1 guidelines for web accessibility"],"zh":["支持 ARIA Patterns","符合 WCAG 2.1 标准","实现无障碍按钮和模态对话框","使用 TypeScript 和 React 构建","支持自定义按钮和模态对话框"],"ja":["ARIA Patterns をサポート","WCAG 2.1 に準拠","アクセシブルなボタンとモーダル ダイアログを実装","TypeScript と React を使用して構築","カスタム ボタンとモーダル ダイアログをサポート"],"ko":["ARIA 패턴 지원","WCAG 2.1 준수","웹 접근성 버튼과 모달 대화상자를 구현","TypeScript와 React를 사용하여 구축","사용자 지정 버튼과 모달 대화상자를 지원"],"es":["Implementación de patrones ARIA para botones y diálogos modales","Uso de atributos aria-pressed y aria-disabled para mejorar la accesibilidad","Creación de diálogos modales accesibles con role=\"dialog\" y aria-modal=\"true\"","Incorporación de etiquetas aria-labelledby y aria-describedby para describir elementos","Compatibilidad con las pautas de accesibilidad web de WCAG 2.1"],"fr":["Mise en œuvre de modèles ARIA pour les boutons et les boîtes de dialogue modales","Utilisation des attributs aria-pressed et aria-disabled pour améliorer l''accessibilité","Création de boîtes de dialogue modales accessibles avec role=\"dialog\" et aria-modal=\"true\"","Intégration des balises aria-labelledby et aria-describedby pour décrire les éléments","Compatibilité avec les directives d''accessibilité web de WCAG 2.1"],"de":["Implementierung von ARIA-Mustern für Schaltflächen und modale Dialoge","Verwendung der Attribute aria-pressed und aria-disabled zur Verbesserung der Zugänglichkeit","Erstellung von zugänglichen modalen Dialogen mit role=\"dialog\" und aria-modal=\"true\"","Einbindung von aria-labelledby- und aria-describedby-Labels zur Beschreibung von Elementen","Kompatibilität mit den Richtlinien für Web-Accessibility von WCAG 2.1"],"pt":["Implementação de padrões ARIA para botões e diálogos modais","Suporte a WCAG 2.1 para acessibilidade web","Criação de aplicações web acessíveis com React e TypeScript","Uso de atributos ARIA para melhorar a acessibilidade","Integração com ferramentas de IA para melhorar a acessibilidade"],"ru":["Реализация паттернов ARIA для кнопок и модальных диалогов","Поддержка WCAG 2.1 для веб-доступности","Создание веб-приложений с доступностью, используя React и TypeScript","Использование атрибутов ARIA для улучшения доступности","Интеграция с ИИ Агентами для улучшения доступности"],"ar":["تنفيذ نمطز ARIA لزر و حوارات مودال","دعم WCAG 2.1 لتحقيق إمكانية الوصول إلى الويب","إنشاء تطبيقات ويب قابلة للوصول باستخدام React و TypeScript","استخدام سمات ARIA لتحسين إمكانية الوصول","التكامل مع أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي لتحسين إمكانية الوصول"]},"keywords":{"en":["how to use web-accessibility","web-accessibility setup guide","WCAG 2.1 compliance","ARIA patterns for buttons","modal dialog accessibility","web-accessibility vs accessibility guidelines","install web-accessibility","web-accessibility best practices","web-accessibility for developers","accessible web applications"],"zh":["Web Accessibility","AIエージェント","WCAG 2.1","ARIA Patterns","TypeScript","React","无障碍 Web 应用","アクセシブルな Web アプリケーション"],"ja":["Web Accessibility","AIエージェント","WCAG 2.1","ARIA Patterns","TypeScript","React","アクセシブルな Web アプリケーション","アクセシビリティ"],"ko":["웹 접근성","AI 에이전트","WCAG 2.1","ARIA 패턴","TypeScript","React","웹 접근성 애플리케이션","접근성"],"es":["accesibilidad web","WCAG 2.1","patrones ARIA","botones accesibles","diálogos modales accesibles","atrributos aria","desarrollo web accesible","herramientas de accesibilidad web"],"fr":["accessibilité web","WCAG 2.1","modèles ARIA","boutons accessibles","boîtes de dialogue modales accessibles","attributs aria","développement web accessible","outils d''accessibilité web"],"de":["Web-Accessibility","WCAG 2.1","ARIA-Muster","zugängliche Schaltflächen","zugängliche modale Dialoge","aria-Attribute","zugängliches Webdesign","KI-Tools für Web-Accessibility"],"pt":["acessibilidade web","padrões ARIA","WCAG 2.1","React","TypeScript","ferramentas de IA","desenvolvimento web acessível","aplicações web acessíveis","acessibilidade web com IA"],"ru":["веб-доступность","паттерны ARIA","WCAG 2.1","React","TypeScript","ИИ Агенты","разработка веб-приложений с доступностью","веб-приложения с доступностью","веб-доступность с ИИ"],"ar":["إمكانية الوصول إلى الويب","نمطز ARIA","WCAG 2.1","React","TypeScript","أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي","تطوير تطبيقات ويب قابلة للوصول","تطبيقات ويب قابلة للوصول","إمكانية الوصول إلى الويب مع الذكاء الاصطناعي"]}},"owner":"zomeru","repo":"rezumerai","repoPath":"zomeru/rezumerai","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-03T10:53:58Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"web-accessibility","description":"Build accessible web applications following WCAG guidelines. Use when implementing ARIA patterns, keyboard navigation, screen reader support, or ensuring accessibility compliance. Triggers on accessibility, a11y, WCAG, ARIA, screen reader, keyboard navigation.","bodyPreview":"# Web Accessibility (WCAG 2.1)\n\nBuild accessible web applications that work for everyone.\n\n## ARIA Patterns\n\n### Button\n```tsx\n<button\n  type=\"button\"\n  aria-pressed={isPressed}\n  aria-disabled={isDisabled}\n  onClick={handleClick}\n>\n  Toggle Feature\n</button>\n```\n\n### Modal Dialog\n```tsx\n<div\n  role=\"dialog\"\n  aria-modal=\"true\"\n  aria-labelledby=\"modal-title\"\n  aria-describedby=\"modal-description\"\n>\n  <h2 id=\"modal-title\">Confirm Action</h2>\n  <p id=\"modal-description\">Are you sure you want to p","body":"# Web Accessibility (WCAG 2.1)\n\nBuild accessible web applications that work for everyone.\n\n## ARIA Patterns\n\n### Button\n```tsx\n<button\n  type=\"button\"\n  aria-pressed={isPressed}\n  aria-disabled={isDisabled}\n  onClick={handleClick}\n>\n  Toggle Feature\n</button>\n```\n\n### Modal Dialog\n```tsx\n<div\n  role=\"dialog\"\n  aria-modal=\"true\"\n  aria-labelledby=\"modal-title\"\n  aria-describedby=\"modal-description\"\n>\n  <h2 id=\"modal-title\">Confirm Action</h2>\n  <p id=\"modal-description\">Are you sure you want to proceed?</p>\n  <button onClick={onConfirm}>Confirm</button>\n  <button onClick={onCancel}>Cancel</button>\n</div>\n```\n\n### Navigation Menu\n```tsx\n<nav aria-label=\"Main navigation\">\n  <ul role=\"menubar\">\n    <li role=\"none\">\n      <a role=\"menuitem\" href=\"/home\">Home</a>\n    </li>\n    <li role=\"none\">\n      <button\n        role=\"menuitem\"\n        aria-haspopup=\"true\"\n        aria-expanded={isOpen}\n      >\n        Products\n      </button>\n      {isOpen && (\n        <ul role=\"menu\" aria-label=\"Products submenu\">\n          <li role=\"none\">\n            <a role=\"menuitem\" href=\"/products/new\">New</a>\n          </li>\n        </ul>\n      )}\n    </li>\n  </ul>\n</nav>\n```\n\n## Keyboard Navigation\n\n### Focus Management\n```tsx\nimport { useEffect, useRef } from ''react'';\n\nfunction Modal({ isOpen, onClose, children }) {\n  const modalRef = useRef<HTMLDivElement>(null);\n  const previousFocus = useRef<HTMLElement | null>(null);\n\n  useEffect(() => {\n    if (isOpen) {\n      previousFocus.current = document.activeElement as HTMLElement;\n      modalRef.current?.focus();\n    } else {\n      previousFocus.current?.focus();\n    }\n  }, [isOpen]);\n\n  // Trap focus within modal\n  const handleKeyDown = (e: React.KeyboardEvent) => {\n    if (e.key === ''Escape'') {\n      onClose();\n    }\n    \n    if (e.key === ''Tab'') {\n      const focusable = modalRef.current?.querySelectorAll(\n        ''button, [href], input, select, textarea, [tabindex]:not([tabindex=\"-1\"])''\n      );\n      \n      if (focusable && focusable.length > 0) {\n        const first = focusable[0] as HTMLElement;\n        const last = focusable[focusable.length - 1] as HTMLElement;\n        \n        if (e.shiftKey && document.activeElement === first) {\n          e.preventDefault();\n          last.focus();\n        } else if (!e.shiftKey && document.activeElement === last) {\n          e.preventDefault();\n          first.focus();\n        }\n      }\n    }\n  };\n\n  if (!isOpen) return null;\n\n  return (\n    <div\n      ref={modalRef}\n      role=\"dialog\"\n      aria-modal=\"true\"\n      tabIndex={-1}\n      onKeyDown={handleKeyDown}\n    >\n      {children}\n    </div>\n  );\n}\n```\n\n## Color Contrast\n\nMinimum contrast ratios (WCAG AA):\n- Normal text: 4.5:1\n- Large text (18pt+): 3:1\n- UI components: 3:1\n\n```typescript\nfunction getContrastRatio(color1: string, color2: string): number {\n  const lum1 = getLuminance(color1);\n  const lum2 = getLuminance(color2);\n  const lighter = Math.max(lum1, lum2);\n  const darker = Math.min(lum1, lum2);\n  return (lighter + 0.05) / (darker + 0.05);\n}\n\nfunction getLuminance(hex: string): number {\n  const rgb = hexToRgb(hex);\n  const [r, g, b] = rgb.map((c) => {\n    c = c / 255;\n    return c <= 0.03928 ? c / 12.92 : Math.pow((c + 0.055) / 1.055, 2.4);\n  });\n  return 0.2126 * r + 0.7152 * g + 0.0722 * b;\n}\n```\n\n## Accessible Forms\n\n```tsx\n<form onSubmit={handleSubmit}>\n  <div>\n    <label htmlFor=\"email\">\n      Email address\n      <span aria-hidden=\"true\">*</span>\n      <span className=\"sr-only\">(required)</span>\n    </label>\n    <input\n      id=\"email\"\n      type=\"email\"\n      aria-required=\"true\"\n      aria-invalid={errors.email ? ''true'' : ''false''}\n      aria-describedby={errors.email ? ''email-error'' : undefined}\n    />\n    {errors.email && (\n      <p id=\"email-error\" role=\"alert\" className=\"error\">\n        {errors.email}\n      </p>\n    )}\n  </div>\n  \n  <button type=\"submit\">Submit</button>\n</form>\n```\n\n## Screen Reader Only Content\n\n```css\n.sr-only {\n  position: absolute;\n  width: 1px;\n  height: 1px;\n  padding: 0;\n  margin: -1px;\n  overflow: hidden;\n  clip: rect(0, 0, 0, 0);\n  white-space: nowrap;\n  border: 0;\n}\n```\n\n## Testing\n\n```bash\n# Automated testing\nnpm install -D axe-core @axe-core/react\n\n# In tests\nimport { axe, toHaveNoViolations } from ''jest-axe'';\nexpect.extend(toHaveNoViolations);\n\ntest(''component is accessible'', async () => {\n  const { container } = render(<MyComponent />);\n  const results = await axe(container);\n  expect(results).toHaveNoViolations();\n});\n```\n\n## Resources\n\n- **WCAG 2.1 Guidelines**: https://www.w3.org/WAI/WCAG21/quickref/\n- **ARIA Authoring Practices**: https://www.w3.org/WAI/ARIA/apg/\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-07T03:58:01.683Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Frontend Agents requiring WCAG 2.1 compliance and ARIA pattern implementation for accessible web applications.","zh":"适用于需要WCAG 2.1合规性和ARIA模式实现的可访问Web应用程序的前端代理。","ja":"WCAG 2.1の準拠とARIAパターンの実装が必要なフロントエンドエージェントに適しています。","ko":"WCAG 2.1 준수 및 ARIA 패턴 구현이 필요한 프론트엔드 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes Frontend que requieren cumplimiento con WCAG 2.1 y implementación de patrones ARIA para aplicaciones web accesibles.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents Frontend nécessitant une conformité WCAG 2.1 et une mise en œuvre de modèles ARIA pour des applications web accessibles.","de":"Ideal für Frontend-Agents, die die Einhaltung von WCAG 2.1 und die Implementierung von ARIA-Mustern für zugängliche Webanwendungen erfordern.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Frontend que exigem conformidade com a WCAG 2.1 e implementação de padrões ARIA para aplicações web acessíveis.","ru":"Идеально для агентов Frontend, требующих соответствия WCAG 2.1 и реализации шаблонов ARIA для доступных веб-приложений.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الأماميين الذين يتطلبون مطابقة WCAG 2.1 وتنفيذ أنماط ARIA لتطبيقات الويب المتوافقة."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to build inclusive web interfaces using ARIA attributes, such as aria-pressed and aria-disabled, and following WCAG 2.1 guidelines for modal dialogs and button elements, ensuring seamless interactions for users with disabilities.","zh":"赋予代理构建包容性Web接口的能力，使用ARIA属性（如aria-pressed和aria-disabled），并遵循WCAG 2.1指南，以确保用户与模态对话框和按钮元素的无缝交互。","ja":"ARIA属性（aria-pressedやaria-disabledなど）を使用し、モーダルダイアログやボタンの要素についてWCAG 2.1ガイドラインに従うことで、ユーザーが障害を持っている場合でもシームレスなインタラクションを可能にする、包摂的なWebインターフェイスを構築するエージェントの能力を付与します。","ko":"ARIA 속성(aria-pressed 및 aria-disabled 등)을 사용하고 모달 대화상자 및 버튼 요소에 대해 WCAG 2.1 지침을 따르므로 사용자가 장애를 가지고 있는 경우에도無縫한 상호 작용을 보장하는 包容性 웹 인터페이스를 구축할 수 있는 에이전트의 능력을 부여합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a crear interfaces web inclusivas utilizando atributos ARIA, como aria-pressed y aria-disabled, y siguiendo las pautas WCAG 2.1 para diálogos modales y elementos de botón, garantizando interacciones sin problemas para usuarios con discapacidades.","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer des interfaces web inclusives en utilisant des attributs ARIA, tels que aria-pressed et aria-disabled, et en suivant les directives WCAG 2.1 pour les dialogues modaux et les éléments de bouton, garantissant des interactions sans problème pour les utilisateurs ayant des handicaps.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, inclusive Web-Oberflächen mit ARIA-Attributen wie aria-pressed und aria-disabled zu erstellen und den WCAG 2.1-Richtlinien für modale Dialoge und Schaltflächenelemente zu folgen, um eine nahtlose Interaktion für Benutzer mit Behinderungen sicherzustellen.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a construir interfaces web inclusivas usando atributos ARIA, como aria-pressed e aria-disabled, e seguindo as diretrizes WCAG 2.1 para diálogos modais e elementos de botão, garantindo interações sem problemas para usuários com deficiência.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью создавать инклюзивные веб-интерфейсы, используя атрибуты ARIA, такие как aria-pressed и aria-disabled, и следуя руководящим принципам WCAG 2.1 для модальных диалогов и элементов кнопок, обеспечивая бесперебойное взаимодействие для пользователей с ограниченными возможностями.","ar":"يُمكّن الوكلاء من بناء واجهات ويب شاملة باستخدام سمات ARIA، مثل aria-pressed وaria-disabled، وتطبيق إرشادات WCAG 2.1 لحوارات الوضع وعناصر الأزرار، مما يضمن تفاعلات دون عائق للمستخدمين ذوي الإعاقة."},"useCases":{"en":["Implementing ARIA patterns for modal dialogs and buttons","Validating web application accessibility against WCAG 2.1 guidelines","Generating accessible HTML elements with aria attributes"],"zh":["为模态对话框和按钮实现ARIA模式","验证Web应用程序的可访问性是否符合WCAG 2.1指南","使用aria属性生成可访问的HTML元素"],"ja":["モーダルダイアログやボタンの要素についてARIAパターンを実装する","WebアプリケーションのアクセシビリティをWCAG 2.1ガイドラインに基づいて検証する","aria属性を使用してアクセシブルなHTML要素を生成する"],"ko":["모달 대화상자 및 버튼에 대한 ARIA 패턴 구현","웹 애플리케이션의 접근성 확인을 위해 WCAG 2.1 지침 준수","aria 속성을 사용하여 접근 가능한 HTML 요소를 생성"],"es":["Implementar patrones ARIA para diálogos modales y botones","Validar la accesibilidad de aplicaciones web contra las pautas WCAG 2.1","Generar elementos HTML accesibles con atributos aria"],"fr":["Mettre en œuvre des modèles ARIA pour les dialogues modaux et les boutons","Valider l''accessibilité des applications web par rapport aux directives WCAG 2.1","Générer des éléments HTML accessibles avec des attributs aria"],"de":["ARIA-Muster für modale Dialoge und Schaltflächen implementieren","Die Zugänglichkeit von Webanwendungen anhand der WCAG 2.1-Richtlinien überprüfen","Zugängliche HTML-Elemente mit aria-Attributen generieren"],"pt":["Implementar padrões ARIA para diálogos modais e botões","Validar a acessibilidade de aplicações web contra as diretrizes WCAG 2.1","Gerar elementos HTML acessíveis com atributos aria"],"ru":["Реализация шаблонов ARIA для модальных диалогов и кнопок","Проверка доступности веб-приложений на соответствие руководящим принципам WCAG 2.1","Генерация доступных элементов HTML с атрибутами aria"],"ar":["تنفيذ أنماط ARIA لحوارات الوضع وأزرار","التحقق من توافق تطبيقات الويب مع إرشادات WCAG 2.1","توليد عناصر HTML المتوافقة مع سمات aria"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires knowledge of HTML, CSS, and JavaScript","Limited to web applications using ARIA patterns and WCAG 2.1 guidelines"],"zh":["需要HTML、CSS和JavaScript的知识","仅限于使用ARIA模式和WCAG 2.1指南的Web应用程序"],"ja":["HTML、CSS、JavaScriptの知識が必要","ARIAパターンとWCAG 2.1ガイドラインを使用するWebアプリケーションに限定される"],"ko":["HTML, CSS, JavaScript에 대한 지식이 필요","ARIA 패턴 및 WCAG 2.1 지침을 사용하는 웹 애플리케이션으로 제한"],"es":["Requiere conocimiento de HTML, CSS y JavaScript","Limitado a aplicaciones web que utilizan patrones ARIA y pautas WCAG 2.1"],"fr":["Nécessite des connaissances en HTML, CSS et JavaScript","Limité aux applications web utilisant des modèles ARIA et des directives WCAG 2.1"],"de":["Benötigt Kenntnisse von HTML, CSS und JavaScript","Begrenzt auf Webanwendungen, die ARIA-Muster und WCAG 2.1-Richtlinien verwenden"],"pt":["Exige conhecimento de HTML, CSS e JavaScript","Limitado a aplicações web que usam padrões ARIA e diretrizes WCAG 2.1"],"ru":["Требует знаний HTML, CSS и JavaScript","Ограничен веб-приложениями, использующими шаблоны ARIA и руководящие принципы WCAG 2.1"],"ar":["يتطلب معرفة HTML وCSS وJavaScript","محدود بتطبيقات الويب التي تستخدم أنماط ARIA وإرشادات WCAG 2.1"]},"version":4},"contentHash":"fb3418ae0f2ad37b788fec511186abd525abd685f464054760e37c00e54e45cf","qualityScore":39}');
