de línea de comandos para interactuar con GitHub","fr":"GitHub CLI (gh) est un outil de ligne de commande pour interagir avec GitHub","de":"GitHub CLI (gh) ist ein Kommandozeilen-Tool zur Interaktion mit GitHub","pt":"O GitHub CLI (gh) é uma ferramenta de linha de comando que permite interagir com o GitHub","ru":"GitHub CLI (gh) - это инструмент командной строки, который позволяет взаимодействовать с GitHub","ar":"واجهة سطر الأوامر GitHub (gh) هي أداة سطر أوامر تتيح التفاعل مع GitHub"},"features":{"en":["Authenticate with GitHub using `gh auth login` and `gh auth status` commands","View current repository details with `gh repo view` command","List and manage pull requests using `gh pr list` and `gh pr create` commands","List and manage issues using `gh issue list` command","Supports terminal-based interaction for efficient GitHub management"],"zh":["终端交互式GitHub管理","支持仓库、问题、拉取请求和发布管理","快速身份验证和状态检查","创建和管理拉取请求","查看和管理问题"],"ja":["ターミナルベースのGitHub管理","リポジトリ、課題、プルリクエスト、リリースの管理をサポート","迅速な認証とステータス確認","プルリクエストの作成と管理","課題の表示と管理"],"ko":["터미널 기반 GitHub 관리","저장소, 문제, 풀 요청 및 릴리스 관리 지원","빠른 인증 및 상태 확인","풀 요청 생성 및 관리","문제 보기 및 관리"],"es":["Autenticación mediante `gh auth login`","Visualización de repositorios con `gh repo view`","Lista de solicitudes de extracción con `gh pr list`","Creación de solicitudes de extracción con `gh pr create`","Gestión de problemas con `gh issue list`"],"fr":["Authentification via `gh auth login`","Affichage des référentiels avec `gh repo view`","Liste des demandes d''extraction avec `gh pr list`","Création de demandes d''extraction avec `gh pr create`","Gestion des problèmes avec `gh issue list`"],"de":["Authentifizierung über `gh auth login`","Anzeige von Repositories mit `gh repo view`","Auflistung von Pull-Requests mit `gh pr list`","Erstellung von Pull-Requests mit `gh pr create`","Verwaltung von Problemen mit `gh issue list`"],"pt":["Autenticação com `gh auth login`","Visualização de repositórios com `gh repo view`","Listagem de pull requests com `gh pr list`","Criação de pull requests com `gh pr create`","Gerenciamento de issues com `gh issue list`"],"ru":["Аутентификация с помощью `gh auth login`","Просмотр репозиториев с помощью `gh repo view`","Список запросов на включение с помощью `gh pr list`","Создание запросов на включение с помощью `gh pr create`","Управление проблемами с помощью `gh issue list`"],"ar":["التحقق من الهوية باستخدام `gh auth login`","عرض المستودعات باستخدام `gh repo view`","قائمة الطلبات السحابية باستخدام `gh pr list`","إنشاء الطلبات السحابية باستخدام `gh pr create`","إدارة القضايا باستخدام `gh issue list`"]},"keywords":{"en":["how to use github-cli","github-cli setup guide","github-cli alternative","github-cli vs git","github-cli install","github-cli authentication","terminal-based github management","github-cli commands","github-cli tutorial"],"zh":["GitHub CLI","AI工具","终端交互","仓库管理","问题管理","拉取请求管理","GitHub命令行接口"],"ja":["GitHub CLI","AIエージェント","ターミナルベース","リポジトリ管理","課題管理","プルリクエスト管理","GitHubコマンドラインインターフェイス"],"ko":["GitHub CLI","AI 에이전트","터미널 기반","저장소 관리","문제 관리","풀 요청 관리","GitHub 명령줄 인터페이스"],"es":["github cli","terminal github","gestión de repositorios","solicitudes de extracción","problemas github","autenticación github","herramientas de desarrollo","github para desarrolladores"],"fr":["github cli","terminal github","gestion de référentiels","demandes d''extraction","problèmes github","authentification github","outils de développement","github pour les développeurs"],"de":["github cli","terminal github","repository-verwaltung","pull-requests","probleme github","authentifizierung github","entwicklertools","github für entwickler"],"pt":["github cli","github cli tutorial","github cli guia","github cli configuração","github cli autenticação","github cli repositórios","github cli pull requests","github cli issues"],"ru":["github cli","github cli руководство","github cli настройка","github cli аутентификация","github cli репозитории","github cli запросы на включение","github cli проблемы","ИИ Агенты для разработчиков"],"ar":["واجهة سطر الأوامر github","دليل واجهة سطر الأوامر github","إعداد واجهة سطر الأوامر github","تحقق من الهوية واجهة سطر الأوامر github","مستودعات واجهة سطر الأوامر github","طلبات سحابية واجهة سطر الأوامر github","قضايا واجهة سطر الأوامر github","أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي لل مطورين"]}},"owner":"trotsky1997","repo":"My-Claude-Agent-Skills","repoPath":"trotsky1997/My-Claude-Agent-Skills","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-08T01:57:15.265Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"github-cli","description":"Comprehensive guide for using GitHub CLI (gh) to interact with GitHub from the command line. Use when (1) Managing GitHub repositories, issues, pull requests, or releases from terminal, (2) Automating GitHub workflows in scripts, (3) Creating or managing pull requests, (4) Working with GitHub issues, (5) Creating releases or managing repository operations, (6) Integrating GitHub operations into development workflows, (7) Using GitHub CLI commands in automation scripts","bodyPreview":"# GitHub CLI (gh)\n\nGitHub CLI (`gh`) enables terminal-based interaction with GitHub for managing repositories, issues, pull requests, and releases.\n\n## Quick Start\n\n**Authentication:**\n\n```bash\ngh auth login          # First-time setup\ngh auth status         # Check authentication\n```\n\n**Basic operations:**\n\n```bash\ngh repo view                    # View current repository\ngh pr list                      # List pull requests\ngh issue list                   # List issues\ngh pr create","body":"# GitHub CLI (gh)\n\nGitHub CLI (`gh`) enables terminal-based interaction with GitHub for managing repositories, issues, pull requests, and releases.\n\n## Quick Start\n\n**Authentication:**\n\n```bash\ngh auth login          # First-time setup\ngh auth status         # Check authentication\n```\n\n**Basic operations:**\n\n```bash\ngh repo view                    # View current repository\ngh pr list                      # List pull requests\ngh issue list                   # List issues\ngh pr create                    # Create pull request\n```\n\n## Core Workflows\n\n### Repository Operations\n\n**View repository:**\n\n```bash\ngh repo view OWNER/REPO\ngh repo view --web              # Open in browser\n```\n\n**Clone and create:**\n\n```bash\ngh repo clone OWNER/REPO\ngh repo create my-repo --public\ngh repo create my-repo --private --clone\n```\n\n**List repositories:**\n\n```bash\ngh repo list                    # Your repos\ngh repo list USERNAME           # User''s repos\ngh repo list --limit 10\n```\n\n### Pull Request Workflow\n\n**Create PR:**\n\n```bash\n# Interactive\ngh pr create\n\n# Direct\ngh pr create --title \"feat: feature\" --body \"description\"\ngh pr create --draft            # Draft PR\ngh pr create --base main --head feature-branch\n```\n\n**Manage PRs:**\n\n```bash\ngh pr list                      # List PRs\ngh pr view PR_NUMBER            # View PR\ngh pr checkout PR_NUMBER        # Checkout locally\ngh pr merge PR_NUMBER           # Merge PR\ngh pr close PR_NUMBER           # Close PR\ngh pr review PR_NUMBER --approve # Review\n```\n\n**PR status and diff:**\n\n```bash\ngh pr checks PR_NUMBER          # Check status\ngh pr diff PR_NUMBER            # View diff\ngh pr view PR_NUMBER --web      # Open in browser\n```\n\n### Issue Management\n\n**Create and list:**\n\n```bash\ngh issue create --title \"Bug: title\" --body \"description\"\ngh issue list                   # List open issues\ngh issue list --state all       # All issues\ngh issue list --label \"bug\"     # Filter by label\n```\n\n**Manage issues:**\n\n```bash\ngh issue view ISSUE_NUMBER\ngh issue close ISSUE_NUMBER --comment \"Fixed\"\ngh issue reopen ISSUE_NUMBER\ngh issue edit ISSUE_NUMBER --title \"New title\"\n```\n\n### Release Management\n\n**Create release:**\n\n```bash\ngh release create v1.0.0 --title \"v1.0.0\" --notes \"Release notes\"\ngh release create v1.0.0 --notes-file CHANGELOG.md\ngh release create v1.0.0 --prerelease  # Pre-release\ngh release create v1.0.0 dist/*.zip    # With assets\n```\n\n**Manage releases:**\n\n```bash\ngh release list\ngh release view TAG_NAME\ngh release download TAG_NAME\ngh release delete TAG_NAME\n```\n\n## Configuration\n\n**Set editor:**\n\n```bash\ngh config set editor \"code -w\"  # VS Code\ngh config set editor \"vim\"\n```\n\n**Create aliases:**\n\n```bash\ngh alias set prl \"pr list\"\ngh alias set prd \"pr create --draft\"\ngh alias set il \"issue list\"\ngh alias list                  # View aliases\n```\n\n**Git credentials:**\n\n```bash\ngh auth setup-git\n```\n\n## Advanced Usage\n\n### JSON Output and Filtering\n\n**JSON output:**\n\n```bash\ngh pr list --json number,title,author\ngh repo view --json name,stargazerCount,url\ngh issue view ISSUE_NUMBER --json title,body,comments\n```\n\n**With jq filtering:**\n\n```bash\ngh pr list --json number,title,author --jq ''.[] | select(.author.login == \"username\")''\n```\n\n### Automation Scripts\n\n**Create PR script:**\n\n```bash\n#!/bin/bash\nBRANCH=$(git branch --show-current)\ngh pr create --title \"feat: feature\" --body \"Description\" --base main --head \"$BRANCH\"\n```\n\n**Check PR status:**\n\n```bash\n#!/bin/bash\nSTATUS=$(gh pr view $1 --json state --jq ''.state'')\necho \"PR #$1 status: $STATUS\"\n```\n\n### Search\n\n```bash\ngh search repos \"language:python stars:>1000\"\ngh search issues \"is:open label:bug\"\ngh search code \"function_name\"\n```\n\n## Common Patterns\n\n**Daily development:**\n\n```bash\ngit checkout -b feature/new-feature\ngit push -u origin feature/new-feature\ngh pr create --title \"feat: new feature\" --body \"Description\"\n# After merge:\ngit checkout main && git pull && git branch -d feature/new-feature\n```\n\n**Review PR:**\n\n```bash\ngh pr list\ngh pr view PR_NUMBER\ngh pr checkout PR_NUMBER        # Test locally\ngh pr review PR_NUMBER --approve\n```\n\n**Batch operations:**\n\n```bash\n# Close all open issues (use with caution)\ngh issue list --state open --json number --jq ''.[].number'' | xargs -I {} gh issue close {}\n```\n\n## Troubleshooting\n\n**Authentication:**\n\n```bash\ngh auth status                 # Check status\ngh auth login                  # Re-authenticate\ngh auth logout                 # Clear auth\n```\n\n**Environment variables:**\n\n```bash\nexport GITHUB_TOKEN=your_token  # Linux/Mac\n$env:GITHUB_TOKEN=\"token\"      # Windows PowerShell\n```\n\n## References\n\nFor detailed command reference and advanced workflows, see:\n\n- [commands.md](references/commands.md) - Complete command reference\n- [workflows.md](references/workflows.md) - Common workflow scenarios\n\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-08T01:59:53.895Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Development Agents needing streamlined GitHub repository management and automation.","zh":"非常适合需要简化GitHub仓库管理和自动化的开发代理。","ja":"GitHubリポジトリの管理と自動化をストリームライン化する必要がある開発エージェントに最適です。","ko":"GitHub 저장소 관리 및 자동화를 간소화해야 하는 개발 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Desarrollo que necesitan una gestión y automatización de repositorios de GitHub optimizadas.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de développement ayant besoin d''une gestion et d''une automatisation de référentiels GitHub rationalisées.","de":"Perfekt für Entwicklungsmittel, die eine optimierte GitHub-Repository-Verwaltung und -Automatisierung benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Desenvolvimento que necessitam de gestão de repositórios GitHub e automação simplificadas.","ru":"Идеально для агентов разработки, которым необходима упрощенная управление репозиториями GitHub и автоматизация.","ar":"مثالي لعميلة التطوير التي تحتاج إلى إدارة مستودعات GitHub وتأتمتة مبسطة."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to manage GitHub repositories, issues, and pull requests directly from the terminal using commands like gh auth, gh repo, and gh pr, facilitating efficient authentication, repository viewing, and issue management through protocols like CLI.","zh":"赋予代理直接从终端使用命令（如gh auth、gh repo和gh pr）管理GitHub仓库、问题和拉取请求的能力，通过诸如CLI的协议实现高效的身份验证、仓库查看和问题管理。","ja":"エージェントがターミナルからコマンド（gh auth、gh repo、gh prなど）を使用してGitHubリポジトリ、問題、プルリクエストを直接管理できるようにし、CLIなどのプロトコルを介して効率的な認証、リポジトリの表示、問題の管理を可能にします。","ko":"에이전트가 터미널에서 명령어(gh auth, gh repo, gh pr 등)를 사용하여 GitHub 저장소, 문제, 풀 요청을 직접 관리할 수 있도록 하며, CLI와 같은 프로토콜을 통해 효율적인 인증, 저장소 보기 및 문제 관리를 제공합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes gestionar repositorios de GitHub, problemas e solicitudes de extracción directamente desde la terminal utilizando comandos como gh auth, gh repo y gh pr, lo que facilita una autenticación eficiente, la visualización de repositorios y la gestión de problemas a través de protocolos como CLI.","fr":"Permet aux agents de gérer les référentiels GitHub, les problèmes et les demandes d''extraction directement depuis le terminal en utilisant des commandes comme gh auth, gh repo et gh pr, ce qui facilite une authentification efficace, la visualisation des référentiels et la gestion des problèmes via des protocoles comme CLI.","de":"Ermöglicht es den Mitteln, GitHub-Repositorys, Probleme und Pull-Requests direkt aus der Terminalverwaltung mithilfe von Befehlen wie gh auth, gh repo und gh pr zu verwalten, wodurch eine effiziente Authentifizierung, Repository-Ansicht und Problemmgmt durch Protokolle wie CLI erleichtert wird.","pt":"Permite que os agentes gerenciem repositórios GitHub, problemas e solicitações de pull diretamente do terminal usando comandos como gh auth, gh repo e gh pr, facilitando a autenticação eficiente, visualização de repositórios e gerenciamento de problemas por meio de protocolos como CLI.","ru":"Позволяет агентам управлять репозиториями GitHub, проблемами и запросами на включение напрямую из терминала, используя команды такие как gh auth, gh repo и gh pr, что облегчает эффективную аутентификацию, просмотр репозиториев и управление проблемами через протоколы seperti CLI.","ar":"يمكن للعميلاء إدارة مستودعات GitHub والقضايا وطلبات السحب مباشرة من الطرفية باستخدام أوامر مثل gh auth و gh repo و gh pr، مما يسهل عملية التحقق من الهوية بكفاءة وعرض المستودعات وإدارة القضايا من خلال بروتوكولات مثل CLI."},"useCases":{"en":["Authenticating with GitHub using gh auth login","Listing and creating pull requests with gh pr list and gh pr create","Managing issues with gh issue list and gh issue view"],"zh":["使用gh auth login进行GitHub身份验证","使用gh pr list和gh pr create列出和创建拉取请求","使用gh issue list和gh issue view管理问题"],"ja":["gh auth loginを使用してGitHubを認証する","gh pr listとgh pr createを使用してプルリクエストを一覧表示および作成する","gh issue listとgh issue viewを使用して問題を管理する"],"ko":["gh auth login을 사용하여 GitHub 인증","gh pr list와 gh pr create를 사용하여 풀 요청 목록 및 생성","gh issue list와 gh issue view를 사용하여 문제 관리"],"es":["Autenticar con GitHub mediante gh auth login","Listar y crear solicitudes de extracción con gh pr list y gh pr create","Gestionar problemas con gh issue list y gh issue view"],"fr":["S''authentifier sur GitHub à l''aide de gh auth login","Lister et créer des demandes d''extraction avec gh pr list et gh pr create","Gérer les problèmes avec gh issue list et gh issue view"],"de":["Sich bei GitHub mithilfe von gh auth login zu authentifizieren","Pull-Requests mit gh pr list und gh pr create auflisten und erstellen","Probleme mit gh issue list und gh issue view verwalten"],"pt":["Autenticar com o GitHub usando gh auth login","Listar e criar solicitações de pull com gh pr list e gh pr create","Gerenciar problemas com gh issue list e gh issue view"],"ru":["Аутентификация с GitHub используя gh auth login","Список и создание запросов на включение с gh pr list и gh pr create","Управление проблемами с gh issue list и gh issue view"],"ar":["التحقق من الهوية مع GitHub باستخدام gh auth login","قائمة وإنشاء طلبات السحب باستخدام gh pr list و gh pr create","إدارة القضايا باستخدام gh issue list و gh issue view"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires GitHub account and CLI installation","Terminal-based interaction only"],"zh":["需要GitHub账户和CLI安装","仅限终端交互"],"ja":["GitHubアカウントとCLIのインストールが必要","ターミナルベースのインタラクションのみ"],"ko":["GitHub 계정 및 CLI 설치 필요","터미널 기반 상호작용만 지원"],"es":["Requiere cuenta de GitHub y instalación de CLI","Interacción basada en terminal solo"],"fr":["Nécessite un compte GitHub et une installation de CLI","Interaction basée sur le terminal uniquement"],"de":["Benötigt ein GitHub-Konto und eine CLI-Installation","Nur terminalbasierte Interaktion"],"pt":["Exige conta GitHub e instalação do CLI","Interação baseada em terminal apenas"],"ru":["Требует учетной записи GitHub и установки CLI","Только терминальное взаимодействие"],"ar":["يتطلب حساب GitHub وتركيب CLI","التفاعل القائم على الطرفية فقط"]},"version":4},"contentHash":"d04c1879739fe39559e360bf988f9b59f40cfae3822db03d6155000caf35dbf7","qualityScore":39}');
