AI que automatiza respuestas a discusiones en GitHub","fr":"L''outil gh-discussions-answerer est un agent d''IA qui automatise les réponses aux discussions GitHub","de":"Der gh-discussions-answerer ist ein KI-Agent, der Antworten auf GitHub-Diskussionen automatisiert","pt":"O gh-discussions-answerer é uma ferramenta de IA que automatiza respostas a discussões não respondidas no GitHub","ru":"ИИ Агент gh-discussions-answerer - это инструмент, который автоматизирует ответы на неотвеченные обсуждения на GitHub","ar":"مرشح المناقشات على جيت هاب هو أداة ذكاء اصطناعي تُستخدم لتشغيل الاستجابات الآلية للنقاشات غير المُجابة على جيت هاب"},"features":{"en":["Delegates work to general subagents for efficient processing","Utilizes the gh CLI for 100% code-verified answers","Auto-posts answers immediately after analysis","Discards only uncertain answers to ensure accuracy","Operates in read-only mode until Phase 3, using only GET/query operations"],"zh":["自动回答未回答的讨论","使用 gh CLI 实现代码验证","支持自动发布答案","具有只读模式，直到 Phase 3","使用 GET/query 操作搜索未回答的讨论","支持 100% 代码验证"],"ja":["自動回答未回答の議論","gh CLI を使用してコード検証を実現","自動回答の公開をサポート","読み取り専用モードを搭載（Phase 3 まで）","GET/query 操作を使用して未回答の議論を検索","100% コード検証をサポート"],"ko":["자동으로 답변되지 않은 토론에 답변","gh CLI를 사용하여 코드 검증을 구현","자동 답변 게시를 지원","읽기 전용 모드 탑재 (Phase 3까지)","GET/query操作을 사용하여 답변되지 않은 토론을 검색","100% 코드 검증을 지원"],"es":["Búsqueda de discusiones no respondidas en GitHub","Verificación de respuestas mediante CLI de GitHub","Publicación automática de respuestas verificadas","Soporte para fases de descubrimiento y análisis","Configuraciones de LLM para respuestas personalizadas"],"fr":["Recherche de discussions non répondues sur GitHub","Vérification des réponses via la CLI de GitHub","Publication automatique des réponses vérifiées","Prise en charge des phases de découverte et d''analyse","Configurations de LLM pour des réponses personnalisées"],"de":["Suche nach unbeantworteten Diskussionen auf GitHub","Überprüfung von Antworten mittels GitHub-CLI","Automatische Veröffentlichung von überprüften Antworten","Unterstützung für Entdeckungs- und Analysephasen","LLM-Konfigurationen für individuelle Antworten"],"pt":["Respostas automatizadas a discussões não respondidas","Verificação de código de 100% via CLI","Configurações personalizadas para o agente","Fase de descoberta para busca de discussões não respondidas","Suporte a múltiplos estágios de processamento"],"ru":["Автоматические ответы на неотвеченные обсуждения","100% кодовая верификация через CLI","Настройка конфигураций для ИИ Агента","Фаза обнаружения для поиска неотвеченных обсуждений","Поддержка нескольких стадий обработки"],"ar":["استجابات آلية للنقاشات غير المُجابة","التحقق الكامل من الشفرة عبر واجهة سطر الأوامر","إعدادات مخصصة للفلاتر الذكية","مرحلة اكتشاف للبحث عن النقاشات غير المُجابة","دعم مراحل المعالجة المتعددة"]},"keywords":{"en":["how to use gh-discussions-answerer","gh-discussions-answerer setup guide","automated GitHub discussions answering","gh-discussions-answerer vs other AI agent skills","gh-discussions-answerer install","what is gh-discussions-answerer","gh-discussions-answerer alternative","LLM harnesses for GitHub discussions","gh CLI for automated answering"],"zh":["GH 讨论回答器","AIエージェント","自动回答","代码验证","gh CLI","GitHub Discussions","开发效率","自动化工具"],"ja":["GitHub Discussions Answerer","AIエージェント","自動回答","コード検証","gh CLI","GitHub Discussions","開発効率","自動化ツール"],"ko":["GH 토론 답변자","AI 에이전트","자동 답변","코드 검증","gh CLI","GitHub Discussions","개발 효율성","자동화 도구"],"es":["herramientas de AI para GitHub","gh-discussions-answerer","configuración de LLM","respuestas automatizadas","CLI de GitHub","discusiones en GitHub","agente de AI para GitHub","automatización de respuestas","GitHub Discussions"],"fr":["outils d''IA pour GitHub","gh-discussions-answerer","configuration de LLM","réponses automatiques","CLI de GitHub","discussions sur GitHub","agent d''IA pour GitHub","automatisation de réponses","GitHub Discussions"],"de":["KI-Tools für GitHub","gh-discussions-answerer","LLM-Konfiguration","automatisierte Antworten","GitHub-CLI","Diskussionen auf GitHub","KI-Agent für GitHub","Automatisierung von Antworten","GitHub-Diskussionen"],"pt":["gh-discussions-answerer","ferramentas de IA para GitHub","respostas automatizadas","verificação de código","configurações personalizadas","ferramentas de desenvolvimento"],"ru":["ИИ Агент gh-discussions-answerer","ИИ инструменты для GitHub","автоматические ответы","кодовая верификация","настраиваемые конфигурации","инструменты разработки"],"ar":["مرشح المناقشات على جيت هاب","أدوات ذكاء اصطناعي لجيت هاب","استجابات آلية","التحقق من الشفرة","إعدادات مخصصة","أدوات التطوير"]}},"owner":"anntnzrb","repo":"agents","repoPath":"anntnzrb/agents","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-08T01:57:15.266Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"gh-discussions-answerer","description":"Find and answer unanswered GitHub discussions. Activate when user wants to contribute to open source discussions, help answer GitHub questions, or find discussions to answer. Delegates all work to subagents.","bodyPreview":"# GitHub Discussions Answerer\n\nAll work delegated to `general` subagents.\n\n## Constraints\n\n- **Target: 10 answers** → find 1.5x candidates\n- **Post ALL verified** (may be lower or higher, that''s fine)\n- **100% code-verified** via `gh` CLI\n- **Discard only uncertain** → post everything that passes\n- **Auto-post** immediately after analysis\n- **Read-only until Phase 3** → Phases 1-2 use only GET/query operations; no mutations\n\n## Workflow\n\n### Phase 1: Discovery\n\nSearch for unanswered discussions","body":"# GitHub Discussions Answerer\n\nAll work delegated to `general` subagents.\n\n## Constraints\n\n- **Target: 10 answers** → find 1.5x candidates\n- **Post ALL verified** (may be lower or higher, that''s fine)\n- **100% code-verified** via `gh` CLI\n- **Discard only uncertain** → post everything that passes\n- **Auto-post** immediately after analysis\n- **Read-only until Phase 3** → Phases 1-2 use only GET/query operations; no mutations\n\n## Workflow\n\n### Phase 1: Discovery\n\nSearch for unanswered discussions via GitHub API:\n\n```\ntask(subagent_type=\"general\", description=\"Search unanswered discussions\", prompt=\"\nRun these searches to find unanswered discussions. Calculate dates from today.\n\nSEARCH 1 - Last 30 days, Q&A with no replies:\ngh api graphql -f query=''{\n  search(query: \\\"is:open comments:0 created:>YYYY-MM-DD category:Q&A NOT author:bot\\\", type: DISCUSSION, first: 100) {\n    nodes { ... on Discussion { title number url bodyText repository { nameWithOwner } category { name } } }\n  }\n}''\n\nSEARCH 2 - Popular repos (stars>100), any unanswered:\ngh api graphql -f query=''{\n  search(query: \\\"is:open comments:0 stars:>100 NOT author:bot NOT title:RFC\\\", type: DISCUSSION, first: 100) {\n    nodes { ... on Discussion { title number url bodyText repository { nameWithOwner } category { name } } }\n  }\n}''\n\nSEARCH 3 - Last 14 days, Help/Support categories:\ngh api graphql -f query=''{\n  search(query: \\\"is:open comments:0 created:>YYYY-MM-DD NOT author:bot NOT title:proposal\\\", type: DISCUSSION, first: 100) {\n    nodes { ... on Discussion { title number url bodyText repository { nameWithOwner } category { name } } }\n  }\n}''\n\nMerge results, deduplicate by repo#number.\n\nINCLUDE categories (prioritized):\n1. Q&A, Questions, Help, Support, Troubleshooting (highest priority)\n2. General (if contains a question mark or asks ''how to'')\n3. Technical, Development, Usage (if asking for help)\n\nHARD SKIP (not answerable with code research):\n- Feature requests (''add X'', ''would be nice if'', ''please implement'')\n- Timeline/roadmap questions (''when will X'', ''release plan'', ''ETA'')\n- Questions only maintainers can answer (prioritization, future plans)\n- Bot-created discussions (mvnpm, dependabot, renovate, github-actions)\n- RFCs/proposals/announcements/newsletters\n- Release notes or changelogs\n- Discussions with only emoji or very short body (<20 chars)\n- Already answered discussions (comments > 0)\n\nReturn exactly 15 candidates: [repo#number] title - category\n\")\n```\n\n### Phase 2: Parallel Analysis\n\nLaunch analyses for ALL candidates in parallel (one subagent per candidate):\n\n```\ntask(subagent_type=\"general\", description=\"Analyze discussion\", prompt=\"\nAnalyze [repo]#[number]: [title]\n\nREAD-ONLY: Only use GET/query operations. Do NOT post, create, or mutate anything.\n\n1. Read discussion: gh api repos/OWNER/REPO/discussions/NUMBER\n2. Search code: gh search code ''keyword'' repo:OWNER/REPO\n3. Read files: gh api repos/OWNER/REPO/contents/PATH --jq ''.content'' | base64 -d\n4. Check README/docs for relevant info\n\nVERIFIED answers must provide ACTIONABLE value:\n- Code fixes with file:line references\n- Configuration solutions with exact syntax\n- Workarounds when expected feature is missing\n- Technical explanation of WHY something doesn''t work\n- Links to relevant documentation in the repo\n\nDISCARD if answer would just restate the question:\n- ''Feature X doesn''t exist'' (user knows, that''s why they asked)\n- ''No timeline available'' (useless)\n- ''This is a known limitation'' (without workaround)\n\nReturn VERIFIED: [1-2 sentence answer with actionable fix] OR DISCARD: [reason]\n\")\n```\n\n### Phase 3: Post All Verified\n\nPost ALL verified answers in parallel (one subagent per answer):\n\n```\ntask(subagent_type=\"general\", description=\"Post discussion answer\", prompt=\"\nPost answer for [repo]#[number]:\n\n1. Get discussion ID:\n   gh api graphql -f query=''{ repository(owner:\\\"X\\\", name:\\\"Y\\\") { discussion(number:N) { id } } }''\n\n2. Post the answer:\n   gh api graphql -f query=''mutation { addDiscussionComment(input: { discussionId: \\\"ID\\\", body: \\\"ANSWER\\\" }) { comment { url } } }''\n\n3. Unsubscribe from notifications\n   THREAD_ID=$(gh api /notifications --jq ''.[] | select(.subject.url | contains(\\\"OWNER/REPO/discussions/NUMBER\\\")) | .id'')\n   gh api -X DELETE /notifications/threads/$THREAD_ID/subscription\n\nReturn posted URL.\n\")\n```\n\n## Answer Format\n\n- 1-2 sentences max\n- File:line if relevant\n- No fluff, no AI-speak\n- Must give user something they can DO, not just confirm what they know\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-08T01:59:58.121Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Code Review Agents needing automated GitHub discussion response capabilities via LLM harnesses and gh CLI verification.","zh":"非常适合需要通过LLM马甲和gh CLI验证自动化GitHub讨论响应的代码审查代理。","ja":"LLMハーネスとgh CLIの検証を介してGitHubのディスカッション応答を自動化する必要があるコードレビューエージェントに最適です。","ko":"LLM 마갑과 gh CLI 검증을 통해 GitHub 토론 응답을 자동화해야 하는 코드 리뷰 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Revisión de Código que necesitan capacidades de respuesta automática de discusiones de GitHub a través de arneses LLM y verificación de CLI de gh.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de révision de code nécessitant des capacités de réponse automatisée de discussion GitHub via des harnais LLM et une vérification CLI de gh.","de":"Perfekt für Code-Review-Agents, die automatisierte GitHub-Diskussionsantwortfunktionen über LLM-Harnesse und gh-CLI-Verifizierung benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Revisão de Código que precisam de capacidades de resposta automática de discussões do GitHub via harnesses LLM e verificação CLI gh.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов кода-ревью, которым необходимы автоматические возможности ответа на обсуждения GitHub через средства LLM и проверку CLI gh.","ar":"مثالي لعميل مراجعة الكود الذي يحتاج إلى khảیات استجابة自动ية لمحادثات جيثب عبر حارات LLM و التحقق من CLI gh."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to automate answering GitHub discussions with accurate and efficient responses using LLM harnesses, 100% code verification via gh CLI, and auto-posting capabilities, leveraging protocols like GET/query operations for read-only analysis.","zh":"赋予代理人使用LLM马甲、100%通过gh CLI的代码验证和自动发布功能，利用GET/查询操作等协议进行只读分析，从而自动化回答GitHub讨论并提供准确高效的响应。","ja":"LLMハーネス、gh CLI経由での100%コード検証、および自動投稿機能を使用して、GET/クエリ操作などのプロトコルを利用した読み取り専用分析により、GitHubのディスカッションに自動で正確で効率的な回答を提供するエージェントを可能にします。","ko":"LLM 마갑, gh CLI를 통한 100% 코드 검증 및 자동 게시 기능을 사용하여 GET/쿼리 연산 등의 프로토콜을 활용한 읽기 전용 분석을 통해 GitHub 토론에 자동으로 정확하고 효율적인 응답을 제공할 수 있는 에이전트를 가능하게 합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a automatizar la respuesta a discusiones de GitHub con respuestas precisas y eficientes utilizando arneses LLM, verificación de código al 100% mediante CLI de gh y capacidades de publicación automática, aprovechando protocolos como operaciones GET/consulta para análisis de solo lectura.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''automatiser les réponses aux discussions GitHub avec des réponses précises et efficaces en utilisant des harnais LLM, une vérification de code à 100% via la CLI de gh et des capacités de publication automatique, en exploitant des protocoles tels que des opérations GET/requête pour une analyse en lecture seule.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, die Beantwortung von GitHub-Diskussionen mit genauen und effizienten Antworten zu automatisieren, indem sie LLM-Harnesse, 100%ige Code-Verifizierung über gh-CLI und automatische Veröffentlichungsfunktionen verwenden, die Protokolle wie GET/Abfrage-Operationen für eine nur-lesbare Analyse nutzen.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a automatizar respostas a discussões do GitHub com respostas precisas e eficientes usando harnesses LLM, verificação de 100% do código via CLI gh e capacidades de postagem automática, aproveitando protocolos como operações GET/consulta para análise somente leitura.","ru":"Позволяет агентам автоматизировать ответы на обсуждения GitHub с точными и эффективными ответами с помощью средств LLM, 100% проверку кода через CLI gh и возможности автоматического публикации, используя протоколы, такие как операции GET/запрос для чтения-only анализа.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على توفير استجابات自動ية لمحادثات جيثب بدقة وفعالية باستخدام حارات LLM والتحقق من 100% من الكود عبر CLI gh ووظائف النشر التلقائي، واستخدام بروتوكولات مثل عمليات GET / استفسار للتحليل القراءة فقط."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating responses to unanswered GitHub discussions","Generating accurate and efficient answers using LLM harnesses","Verifying code responses with 100% accuracy via gh CLI"],"zh":["自动化响应未回答的GitHub讨论","使用LLM马甲生成准确高效的答案","通过gh CLI以100%的准确率验证代码响应"],"ja":["未回答のGitHubディスカッションに自動で回答する","LLMハーネスを使用して正確で効率的な回答を生成する","gh CLIを介してコード応答を100%の精度で検証する"],"ko":["미응답 GitHub 토론에 자동으로 응답하는 것","LLM 마갑을 사용하여 정확하고 효율적인 답변을 생성하는 것","gh CLI를 통해 코드 응답을 100%의 정확도으로 검증하는 것"],"es":["Automatizar respuestas a discusiones de GitHub sin respuesta","Generar respuestas precisas y eficientes utilizando arneses LLM","Verificar respuestas de código con precisión del 100% mediante CLI de gh"],"fr":["Automatiser les réponses aux discussions GitHub sans réponse","Générer des réponses précises et efficaces en utilisant des harnais LLM","Vérifier les réponses de code avec une précision de 100% via la CLI de gh"],"de":["Automatisieren von Antworten auf unbeantwortete GitHub-Diskussionen","Erzeugen von genauen und effizienten Antworten unter Verwendung von LLM-Harnessen","Überprüfen von Code-Antworten mit 100%iger Genauigkeit über gh-CLI"],"pt":["Automatizar respostas a discussões não respondidas do GitHub","Gerar respostas precisas e eficientes usando harnesses LLM","Verificar respostas de código com 100% de precisão via CLI gh"],"ru":["Автоматизировать ответы на неотвеченные обсуждения GitHub","Генерировать точные и эффективные ответы с помощью средств LLM","Проверять ответы кода с 100% точностью через CLI gh"],"ar":["توفير استجابات تلقائية لمحادثات جيثب غير مجابة","توليد استجابات دقيقة وفعالة باستخدام حارات LLM","التحقق من استجابات الكود بدقة 100% عبر CLI gh"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires gh CLI for 100% code verification","Read-only access until Phase 3","Limited to posting 10 answers with 1.5x candidate selection"],"zh":["需要gh CLI进行100%的代码验证","直到第3阶段之前仅限只读访问","发布答案的数量仅限10个，候选者选择上限为1.5倍"],"ja":["100%のコード検証にはgh CLIが必要","第3フェーズまで読み取り専用アクセスのみ","回答の投稿数は10個まで、候補者の選択は1.5倍まで"],"ko":["100% 코드 검증을 위해 gh CLI가 필요함","3단계까지 읽기 전용 접근만 허용됨","답변 게시 수는 10개까지, 후보자 선택은 1.5배까지"],"es":["Requiere CLI de gh para la verificación de código al 100%","Acceso de solo lectura hasta la Fase 3","Limitado a publicar 10 respuestas con selección de candidato 1,5x"],"fr":["Nécessite la CLI de gh pour une vérification de code à 100%","Accès en lecture seule jusqu''à la Phase 3","Limité à la publication de 10 réponses avec une sélection de candidat 1,5x"],"de":["Benötigt gh-CLI für 100%ige Code-Verifizierung","Nur-Lesezugriff bis Phase 3","Begrenzt auf Veröffentlichung von 10 Antworten mit 1,5x-Kandidatenauswahl"],"pt":["Requer CLI gh para verificação de 100% do código","Acesso somente leitura até a Fase 3","Limitado a postar 10 respostas com seleção de candidato 1,5x"],"ru":["Требует CLI gh для 100% проверки кода","Доступ только для чтения до Фазы 3","Ограничен до публикации 10 ответов с выбором кандидата 1,5x"],"ar":["يتطلب CLI gh للتحقق من 100% من الكود","الوصول للقراءة فقط حتى المرحلة 3","محدود بنشر 10 استجابات مع اختيار مرشح 1.5x"]},"version":4},"contentHash":"4621086a327532d50f910f4ab233a27ffc5e0d386a2fbca6dfb4e58fe8102d4a","qualityScore":39}');
