INSERT INTO skills_fts (id, name, owner, repo, category, search_text) VALUES ('cloudflare/moltworker/cloudflare-browser', 'cloudflare-browser', 'cloudflare', 'moltworker', 'community', 'cloudflare-browser cloudflare moltworker community The cloudflare-browser skill enables developers to control headless browsers via Cloudflare Workers using CDP over WebSocket, streamlining browser rendering and automation tasks. Cloudflare 浏览器渲染控制允许您通过 CDP 协议控制 headless 浏览器。使用 OpenClaw 在 Cloudflare Workers 上运行您的浏览器渲染工作流程 Cloudflare ブラウザレンダリング制御は、CDP プロトコルを使用してヘッドレスブラウザを制御できるようにします。OpenClaw を使用して Cloudflare Workers 上でブラウザレンダリングワークフローを実行します Cloudflare 브라우저 렌더링 제어를 사용하여 CDP 프로토콜을 통해 헤드리스 브라우저를 제어할 수 있습니다. OpenClaw를 사용하여 Cloudflare Workers에서 브라우저 렌더링 워크플ロー를 실행합니다 Cloudflare Browser permite controlar navegadores headless mediante CDP y WebSocket. Configura tu entorno con OpenClaw y Workers de Cloudflare. Cloudflare Browser permet de gérer les navigateurs headless via CDP et WebSocket. Configurez votre environnement avec OpenClaw et les Workers de Cloudflare. Cloudflare Browser ermöglicht die Steuerung von headless Browsern über CDP und WebSocket. Konfigurieren Sie Ihre Umgebung mit OpenClaw und Cloudflare Workers. O Cloudflare Browser permite executar OpenClaw em Workers, utilizando o Chrome DevTools Protocol sobre WebSocket. Saiba como configurá-lo Сloudflare Browser позволяет запускать OpenClaw на Workers, используя Chrome DevTools Protocol по WebSocket. Узнайте, как настроить يسمح Cloudflare Browser بتشغيل OpenClaw على Workers، باستخدام Chrome DevTools Protocol عبر WebSocket. تعرف على كيفية الإعداد how to use cloudflare-browser cloudflare-browser setup guide cloudflare-browser vs puppeteer cloudflare-browser install what is cloudflare-browser cloudflare-browser alternative cloudflare-browser tutorial cloudflare-browser and CDP cloudflare-browser WebSocket setup Cloudflare 浏览器渲染控制 OpenClaw CDP 协议 headless 浏览器 Cloudflare Workers WebSocket 浏览器渲染 截图功能 浏览器-profile Utilizes Chrome DevTools Protocol (CDP) for browser control Supports WebSocket protocol for real-time communication Requires CDP_SECRET environment variable setup Configures browser profiles in openclaw.json for customized settings Enables headless browsing via Cloudflare Workers Uses JSON format for configuring browser profiles cloudflare-browser is a skill that allows developers to leverage Cloudflare''s Browser Rendering service for controlling headless browsers via Chrome DevTools Protocol (CDP) over WebSocket');
