ng","zh":"walkerOS Flow 是一个开源的标签管理器，实现可组合的事件处理和模块化的开发","ja":"walkerOS Flow は、組み合わせ可能なイベント処理とモジュラー開発を実現するオープンソースのタグマネージャーです","ko":"walkerOS Flow 는 조합 가능한 이벤트 처리와 모듈화된 개발을 구현하는 개발자를 위한 오픈소스 태그 관리자입니다","es":"walkerOS Flow es un gestor de etiquetas de código abierto que permite el procesamiento de eventos de forma modular y componible","fr":"walkerOS Flow est un gestionnaire de balises open-source qui permet le traitement d''événements de manière modulaire et composable","de":"walkerOS Flow ist ein Open-Source-Tag-Manager, der die modulare und komponierbare Verarbeitung von Ereignissen ermöglicht","pt":"O que é walkerOS Flow? Um gerenciador de tags de código aberto que permite a processamento de eventos compostos e modulares","ru":"Что такое walkerOS Flow? Открытый тег-менеджер, позволяющий обрабатывать составные и модульные события","ar":"ما هو walkerOS Flow؟ مدير تعريف مفتوح المصدر يسمح بمعالجة الأحداث المركبة والقابلة للتعديل"},"features":{"en":["Implements Source → Collector → Destination(s) architecture for composable event processing","Supports Pre-Transformers and Post-Transformers for data validation and processing","Enables replaceable and composable components for modular event handling","Follows a core principle of Separation of concerns for each component","Allows for capture and delivery of events via Destinations"],"zh":["Source → Collector → Destination(s) 的架构","可组合的事件处理","模块化的开发","支持 Pre-Transformers 和 Post-Transformers","实现 Separation of concerns 的核心原则"],"ja":["Source → Collector → Destination(s) のアーキテクチャ","組み合わせ可能なイベント処理","モジュラー開発","Pre-Transformers と Post-Transformers のサポート","Separation of concerns の核心原則の実現"],"ko":["Source → Collector → Destination(s) 의 아키텍처","조합 가능한 이벤트 처리","모듈화된 개발","Pre-Transformers 와 Post-Transformers 의 지원","Separation of concerns 의 핵심 원리의 구현"],"es":["Arquitectura de procesamiento de eventos Source → Collector → Destination(s)","Separación de preocupaciones para cada componente","Componentes componibles y reemplazables","Patrón de flujo Sources → [Pre-Transformers] → Collector → [Post-Transformers] → Destinations","Validación y entrega de eventos"],"fr":["Architecture de traitement d''événements Source → Collector → Destination(s)","Séparation des préoccupations pour chaque composant","Composants componibles et remplaçables","Modèle de flux Sources → [Pre-Transformers] → Collector → [Post-Transformers] → Destinations","Validation et livraison d''événements"],"de":["Ereignisverarbeitungsarchitektur Source → Collector → Destination(s)","Trennung von Belangen für jeden Komponenten","Komponierbare und ersetzbare Komponenten","Flussmuster Sources → [Pre-Transformers] → Collector → [Post-Transformers] → Destinations","Validierung und Lieferung von Ereignissen"],"pt":["Arquitetura modular com separação de preocupações","Componentes compostos e substituíveis","Processamento de eventos em fontes, coletores e destinos","Suporte a pré-transformadores e pós-transformadores","Integração com Browser DOM e validação"],"ru":["Модульная архитектура с разделением проблем","Компонуемые и заменяемые компоненты","Обработка событий в источниках, коллекциях и местах назначения","Поддержка пред-трансформеров и пост-трансформеров","Интеграция с Browser DOM и проверкой"],"ar":["هندسة معمارية قابلة للتعديل مع فصل الاهتمامات","مكونات قابلة للتركيب والاستبدال","معالجة الأحداث في المصادر والمجمعات والوجهات","دعم المُحَوِّلين السابقين واللاحقين","التكامل مع Browser DOM والتحقق"]},"keywords":{"en":["how to use walkeros-understanding-flow","walkeros-understanding-flow alternative","walkeros-understanding-flow setup guide","what is walkeros-understanding-flow","walkeros-understanding-flow vs tag managers","walkeros-understanding-flow install","modular event processing with walkeros-understanding-flow","walkeros-understanding-flow documentation","walkeros-understanding-flow use cases"],"zh":["walkerOS Flow","开源标签管理","事件处理","模块化开发","Source → Collector → Destination(s)","Pre-Transformers","Post-Transformers","Separation of concerns"],"ja":["walkerOS Flow","AIエージェント","オープンソースタグマネージャー","イベント処理","モジュラー開発","Source → Collector → Destination(s)","Pre-Transformers","Post-Transformers","Separation of concerns"],"ko":["walkerOS Flow","개발자를 위한 태그 관리자","오픈소스 태그 관리","이벤트 처리","모듈화된 개발","Source → Collector → Destination(s)","Pre-Transformers","Post-Transformers","Separation of concerns"],"es":["walkerOS Flow","gestor de etiquetas de código abierto","procesamiento de eventos","arquitectura modular","separación de preocupaciones","componentes componibles","validación de eventos","entrega de eventos"],"fr":["walkerOS Flow","gestionnaire de balises open-source","traitement d''événements","architecture modulaire","séparation des préoccupations","composants componibles","validation d''événements","livraison d''événements"],"de":["walkerOS Flow","Open-Source-Tag-Manager","Ereignisverarbeitung","modulare Architektur","Trennung von Belangen","komponierbare Komponenten","Validierung von Ereignissen","Lieferung von Ereignissen"],"pt":["walkerOS Flow","gerenciador de tags de código aberto","arquitetura modular","processamento de eventos compostos","desenvolvedores","open-source","tecnologias de desenvolvimento","ferramentas de desenvolvimento"],"ru":["walkerOS Flow","ИИ Агенты","открытый тег-менеджер","модульная архитектура","обработка составных событий","разработчики","открытый исходный код","технологии разработки","инструменты разработки"],"ar":["walkerOS Flow","مدير تعريف مفتوح المصدر","هندسة معمارية قابلة للتعديل","معالجة الأحداث المركبة","طورين","مفتوح المصدر","تكنولوجيا التطوير","أدوات التطوير"]}},"owner":"elbwalker","repo":"walkerOS","repoPath":"elbwalker/walkerOS","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-08T01:57:15.276Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"walkeros-understanding-flow","description":"","bodyPreview":"# Understanding walkerOS Flow\n\n## Overview\n\nwalkerOS follows a **Source → Collector → Destination(s)** architecture for\ncomposable, modular event processing.\n\n**Core principle:** Separation of concerns. Each component has one job.\nComponents are composable and replaceable.\n\n## The Flow Pattern\n\n```\nSources → [Pre-Transformers] → Collector → [Post-Transformers] → Destinations\n(Capture)  (source.next)    (Processing) (dest.before)       (Delivery)\n\n- Browser DOM              - Validation   - Valid","body":"# Understanding walkerOS Flow\n\n## Overview\n\nwalkerOS follows a **Source → Collector → Destination(s)** architecture for\ncomposable, modular event processing.\n\n**Core principle:** Separation of concerns. Each component has one job.\nComponents are composable and replaceable.\n\n## The Flow Pattern\n\n```\nSources → [Pre-Transformers] → Collector → [Post-Transformers] → Destinations\n(Capture)  (source.next)    (Processing) (dest.before)       (Delivery)\n\n- Browser DOM              - Validation   - Validation        - Google Analytics\n- DataLayer                - Enrichment   - Enrichment        - Meta Pixel\n- Server HTTP              - Redaction    - Consent check     - Custom API\n- Cloud Functions                         - Routing           - Data Warehouse\n```\n\n## Key Concepts\n\n### Composability\n\nA Flow combines components. You can:\n\n- Use multiple sources feeding one collector\n- Route events to multiple destinations\n- Swap components without changing others\n\n### The Flow Type\n\nSee [packages/core/src/types/flow.ts](../../packages/core/src/types/flow.ts) for\nthe canonical interface.\n\n```typescript\n// Conceptual structure (see source for full type)\ninterface Flow {\n  sources?: Record<string, Source>;\n  transformers?: Record<string, Transformer>;\n  destinations?: Record<string, Destination>;\n  collector?: Collector.InitConfig;\n}\n```\n\n### Universal Push Interface\n\n**All components communicate via `push` functions:**\n\n| Component   | Push Signature                | Purpose               |\n| ----------- | ----------------------------- | --------------------- |\n| Source      | `push(input) → events`        | Capture external data |\n| Collector   | `push(event) → void`          | Process and route     |\n| Destination | `push(event, context) → void` | Transform and deliver |\n\nThe `elb()` function is an alias for `collector.push` - used for component\nwiring.\n\n### startFlow Helper\n\nSee [packages/collector/src/flow.ts](../../packages/collector/src/flow.ts) for\nthe `startFlow` function.\n\n```typescript\nimport { startFlow } from ''@walkeros/collector'';\n\nconst { collector, elb } = await startFlow({\n  sources: {\n    /* ... */\n  },\n  transformers: {\n    /* ... */\n  },\n  destinations: {\n    /* ... */\n  },\n});\n```\n\n## Separation of Concerns\n\n| Concern          | Handled By     | NOT Handled By          |\n| ---------------- | -------------- | ----------------------- |\n| Event capture    | Sources        | Collector, Destinations |\n| Event structure  | Event model    | Components              |\n| Consent checking | Collector      | Sources, Destinations   |\n| Transformation   | Mapping system | Raw push calls          |\n| Delivery         | Destinations   | Sources, Collector      |\n\n## Transformer Chains\n\nTransformers run at two points in the pipeline, configured via `next` and\n`before`:\n\n### Pre-Collector Chain\n\nRuns after source captures event, before collector processing:\n\n**Bundled mode (flow.json):**\n\n```json\n{\n  \"sources\": {\n    \"browser\": {\n      \"package\": \"@walkeros/web-source-browser\",\n      \"next\": \"validate\"\n    }\n  },\n  \"transformers\": {\n    \"validate\": {\n      \"package\": \"@walkeros/transformer-validator\",\n      \"next\": \"enrich\"\n    },\n    \"enrich\": {\n      \"package\": \"@walkeros/transformer-enricher\"\n    }\n  }\n}\n```\n\n**Integrated mode (TypeScript):**\n\n```typescript\nsources: {\n  browser: {\n    code: sourceBrowser,\n    next: ''validate''\n  }\n},\ntransformers: {\n  validate: {\n    code: transformerValidator,\n    config: { next: ''enrich'' }\n  },\n  enrich: {\n    code: transformerEnrich\n  }\n}\n```\n\nNote: In flow.json, `next` is at the reference level. The CLI bundler\nautomatically moves it into `config.next` for runtime - you don''t need to handle\nthis yourself.\n\n### Post-Collector Chain\n\nRuns after collector enrichment, before destination receives event:\n\n**Bundled mode (flow.json):**\n\n```json\n{\n  \"destinations\": {\n    \"gtag\": {\n      \"package\": \"@walkeros/web-destination-gtag\",\n      \"before\": \"redact\"\n    }\n  },\n  \"transformers\": {\n    \"redact\": {\n      \"package\": \"@walkeros/transformer-redact\"\n    }\n  }\n}\n```\n\n**Integrated mode (TypeScript):**\n\n```typescript\ndestinations: {\n  gtag: {\n    code: destinationGtag,\n    before: ''redact''\n  }\n},\ntransformers: {\n  redact: {\n    code: transformerRedact\n  }\n}\n```\n\n### Chain Resolution\n\n- `source.next` → starts pre-collector chain\n- `transformer.next` (flow.json) or `transformer.config.next` (runtime) → links\n  transformers\n- `destination.before` → starts post-collector chain per destination\n\n## Related Skills\n\n- [walkeros-understanding-events](../walkeros-understanding-events/SKILL.md) -\n  Event model\n- [walkeros-understanding-sources](../walkeros-understanding-sources/SKILL.md) -\n  Source interface\n- [walkeros-understanding-destinations](../walkeros-understanding-destinations/SKILL.md) -\n  Destination interface\n\n**Package READMEs:**\n\n- [packages/collector/README.md](../../packages/collector/README.md) - Collector\n  details\n\n**Source Files:**\n\n- [packages/collector/src/flow.ts](../../packages/collector/src/flow.ts) -\n  startFlow implementation\n\n**Documentation:**\n\n- [Website: Flow](../../website/docs/getting-started/flow.mdx) - Flow concept\n- [Website: Collector](../../website/docs/collector/index.mdx) - Collector docs\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-08T02:00:40.697Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Modular Event Processing Agents needing composable and replaceable components via a Source → Collector → Destination(s) architecture.","zh":"适用于需要可组合和可替换组件的模块化事件处理代理，通过 Source → Collector → Destination(s) 架构实现。","ja":"モジュラーイベント処理エージェントが、ソース → コレクター → 宛先（s）アーキテクチャを介して組み合わせ可能で交換可能なコンポーネントを必要とする場合に最適です。","ko":"소스 → 수집기 → 목적지(들) 아키텍처를 통해 조합 가능하고 교체 가능한 구성 요소를 필요로 하는 모듈식 이벤트 처리 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Procesamiento de Eventos Modulares que necesitan componentes componibles y reemplazables a través de una arquitectura Source → Collector → Destination(s).","fr":"Parfait pour les Agents de Traitement d''Événements Modulaires ayant besoin de composants componibles et remplaçables via une architecture Source → Collector → Destination(s).","de":"Perfekt für modulare Ereignisverarbeitungsagenten, die komponierbare und ersetzbare Komponenten über eine Source → Collector → Destination(s)-Architektur benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Processamento de Eventos Modulares que necessitam de componentes compostos e substituíveis via arquitetura Source → Collector → Destination(s).","ru":"Идеально подходит для модульных агентов обработки событий, требующих составных и заменяемых компонентов через архитектуру Source → Collector → Destination(s).","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء معالجة الحدث الموديولار الذين يحتاجون إلى مكونات قابلة للتركيب وقابلة للاستبدال عبر 설계 المصدر → المُجمّع → الوجهة (ق)."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to process events in a modular and composable manner using the Source → Collector → Destination(s) pattern, enabling separation of concerns and utilization of pre-transformers and post-transformers for data validation and processing.","zh":"使代理能够以模块化和组合的方式处理事件，使用源 → 收集器 → 目的地（s）模式，实现关注点分离和预转换器和后转换器的利用以进行数据验证和处理。","ja":"ソース → コレクター → 宛先（s）パターンを使用して、モジュラーで構成可能な方法でイベントを処理するエージェントを可能にし、関心の分離と事前変換器および事後変換器の利用を可能にします。","ko":"에이전트가 소스 → 수집기 → 목적지(들) 패턴을 사용하여 모듈식이고 조합 가능한 방식으로 이벤트를 처리할 수 있도록 하여 관심사 분리와 데이터 유효성 검사 및 처리를 위한 사전 변환기 및 사전 변환기를 활용할 수 있습니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a procesar eventos de manera modular y componible utilizando el patrón Source → Collector → Destination(s), lo que permite la separación de preocupaciones y la utilización de pre-transformadores y post-transformadores para la validación y procesamiento de datos.","fr":"Permet aux agents de traiter les événements de manière modulaire et componible en utilisant le modèle Source → Collector → Destination(s), permettant ainsi la séparation des préoccupations et l''utilisation de pré-transformateurs et de post-transformateurs pour la validation et le traitement des données.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, Ereignisse auf modulare und komponierbare Weise zu verarbeiten, indem das Muster Source → Collector → Destination(s) verwendet wird, was die Trennung von Bedenken und die Nutzung von Prä- und Post-Transformern für die Datenvalidierung und -verarbeitung ermöglicht.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a processar eventos de forma modular e composta, utilizando o padrão Source → Collector → Destination(s), permitindo a separação de preocupações e a utilização de pré-transformadores e pós-transformadores para validação e processamento de dados.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью обрабатывать события в модульном и составном порядке, используя шаблон Source → Collector → Destination(s), что позволяет разделить проблемы и использовать пре- и пост-трансформаторы для проверки и обработки данных.","ar":"يمكّن الوكلاء من معالجة الأحداث بطريقة موديولار وقابلة للتركيب، باستخدام نمط المصدر → المُجمّع → الوجهة (ق)، مما يسمح بفصل القلق واستخدام المُحوّلات السابقة والمُحوّلات اللاحقة للتحقق من صحة البيانات ومعالجتها."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating event processing workflows with modular components","Generating customizable data pipelines using the Collector component","Debugging event flows with replaceable pre-transformers and post-transformers"],"zh":["使用模块化组件自动执行事件处理工作流程","使用收集器组件生成可定制的数据管道","使用可替换的预转换器和后转换器调试事件流"],"ja":["モジュラー コンポーネントを使用してイベント処理ワークフローを自動化する","コレクター コンポーネントを使用してカスタマイズ可能なデータ パイプラインを生成する","交換可能な事前変換器と事後変換器を使用してイベント フローをデバッグする"],"ko":["모듈식 구성 요소를 사용하여 이벤트 처리 워크플로를 자동화하는 것","수집기 구성 요소를 사용하여 사용자 지정 가능한 데이터 파이프라인을 생성하는 것","교체 가능한 사전 변환기 및 사전 변환기를 사용하여 이벤트 흐름을 디버깅하는 것"],"es":["Automatizar flujos de trabajo de procesamiento de eventos con componentes modulares","Generar tuberías de datos personalizables utilizando el componente Collector","Depurar flujos de eventos con pre-transformadores y post-transformadores reemplazables"],"fr":["Automatiser les flux de travail de traitement d''événements avec des composants modulaires","Générer des pipelines de données personnalisables en utilisant le composant Collector","Déboguer les flux d''événements avec des pré-transformateurs et des post-transformateurs remplaçables"],"de":["Automatisierung von Ereignisverarbeitungs-Workflows mit modularen Komponenten","Erzeugen von anpassbaren Datenpipelines unter Verwendung der Collector-Komponente","Fehlerbehebung von Ereignisflüssen mit ersetzbarer Prä- und Post-Transformation"],"pt":["Automatizar fluxos de trabalho de processamento de eventos com componentes modulares","Gerar pipelines de dados personalizáveis usando o componente Collector","Depurar fluxos de eventos com pré-transformadores e pós-transformadores substituíveis"],"ru":["Автоматизация рабочих процессов обработки событий с модульными компонентами","Генерация настраиваемых конвейеров данных с помощью компонента Collector","Отладка потоков событий с заменяемыми пре- и пост-трансформаторами"],"ar":["تأتميم تدفقات العمل لمعالجة الأحداث مع المكونات الموديولار","توليد خطوط أنابيب بيانات قابلة للتعديل باستخدام مكون المُجمّع","تصحيح الأخطاء في تدفقات الأحداث مع المُحوّلات السابقة والمُحوّلات اللاحقة القابلة للاستبدال"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires understanding of the Source → Collector → Destination(s) architecture","Limited to event processing use cases","No support for non-modular event processing workflows"],"zh":["需要了解源 → 收集器 → 目的地（s）架构","仅限于事件处理用例","不支持非模块化事件处理工作流"],"ja":["ソース → コレクター → 宛先（s）アーキテクチャを理解する必要がある","イベント処理用ケースのみに限定される","モジュラー化されていないイベント処理ワークフローはサポートされない"],"ko":["소스 → 수집기 → 목적지(들) 아키텍처를 이해해야 함","이벤트 처리 사용 사례에만 제한됨","비모듈식 이벤트 처리 워크플로우는 지원되지 않음"],"es":["Requiere comprensión de la arquitectura Source → Collector → Destination(s)","Limitado a casos de uso de procesamiento de eventos","No admite flujos de trabajo de procesamiento de eventos no modulares"],"fr":["Nécessite une compréhension de l''architecture Source → Collector → Destination(s)","Limité aux cas d''utilisation du traitement d''événements","Ne prend pas en charge les flux de travail de traitement d''événements non modulaires"],"de":["Erfordert das Verständnis der Source → Collector → Destination(s)-Architektur","Begrenzt auf Ereignisverarbeitungs-Anwendungsfälle","Unterstützt keine nicht-modularen Ereignisverarbeitungs-Workflows"],"pt":["Exige compreensão da arquitetura Source → Collector → Destination(s)","Limitado a casos de uso de processamento de eventos","Não há suporte para fluxos de trabalho de processamento de eventos não modulares"],"ru":["Требует понимания архитектуры Source → Collector → Destination(s)","Ограничен случаи использования обработки событий","Нет поддержки для не-модульных рабочих процессов обработки событий"],"ar":["يتطلب فهمًا لتصميم المصدر → المُجمّع → الوجهة (ق)","محدود لcases استخدام معالجة الأحداث","لا يوجد دعم لتدفقات العمل لمعالجة الأحداث غير الموديولار"]},"version":4},"contentHash":"ba6130aed75cca4795fc030c328d2d12620519ffb985d9352ebb275dd8b669c2","qualityScore":39}');
