CAD هو لغة برمجة لإنشاء نماذج 3D"},"features":{"en":["Parameter customization","STL export for 3D printing","Visual preview from multiple angles","Support for MakerWorld 3D printing platform","Installation via Homebrew","Preview generation using CLI tool"],"zh":["参数定制","STL导出用于3D打印","多角度视觉预览","支持MakerWorld 3D打印平台","通过Homebrew安装","使用CLI工具生成预览"],"ja":["パラメータカスタマイズ","STL出力による3Dプリンティング","複数角度からの視覚プレビュー","MakerWorld 3Dプリンティングプラットフォームのサポート","Homebrew経由のインストール","CLIツールを使用したプレビュー生成"],"ko":["파라미터 커스터마이징","STL 내보내기 위한 3D 프린팅","다중 각도에서의 시각적预览","MakerWorld 3D 프린팅 플랫폼 지원","Homebrew를 통한 설치","CLI 도구를 사용한预览 생성"],"es":["Creación de modelos 3D con personalización de parámetros","Previsualización de modelos desde múltiples ángulos","Exportación de modelos 3D en formato STL para impresoras 3D","Compatibilidad con plataformas de impresión 3D como MakerWorld","Herramientas de línea de comandos para la generación de previsualizaciones","Soporte para la instalación via Homebrew"],"fr":["Création de modèles 3D avec personnalisation de paramètres","Prévisualisation de modèles depuis plusieurs angles","Exportation de modèles 3D au format STL pour les imprimantes 3D","Compatibilité avec les plateformes d''impression 3D comme MakerWorld","Outils de ligne de commande pour la génération de prévisualisations","Prise en charge de l''installation via Homebrew"],"de":["Erstellung von 3D-Modellen mit Parameternanpassung","Vorschau von Modellen aus mehreren Perspektiven","Export von 3D-Modellen im STL-Format für 3D-Drucker","Kompatibilität mit 3D-Druckplattformen wie MakerWorld","Befehlszeilenwerkzeuge für die Erstellung von Vorschauen","Unterstützung für die Installation über Homebrew"],"pt":["Criação de modelos 3D personalizados","Pré-visualização de modelos 3D de múltiplos ângulos","Exportação de modelos 3D para STL","Integração com plataformas de impressão 3D como MakerWorld","Uso de comandos Bash para geração de pré-visualizações"],"ru":["Создание пользовательских 3D-моделей","Предварительный просмотр 3D-моделей с нескольких углов","Экспорт 3D-моделей в STL","Интеграция с платформами 3D-печати как MakerWorld","Использование команд Bash для генерации предварительных просмотров"],"ar":["إنشاء نماذج 3D مخصصة","معاينة نماذج 3D من زوايا متعددة","تصدير نماذج 3D إلى STL","التكامل مع منصات印刷 3D مثل MakerWorld","استخدام أوامر Bash لإنشاء معاينات"]},"keywords":{"en":["OpenSCAD installation","3D modeling software","STL export","3D printing platform","MakerWorld","Homebrew installation","CLI tool","parameter customization","visual preview"],"zh":["OpenSCAD安装","3D建模软件","STL导出","3D打印平台","MakerWorld","Homebrew安装","CLI工具","参数定制","视觉预览"],"ja":["OpenSCADのインストール","3Dモデリングソフトウェア","STL出力","3Dプリンティングプラットフォーム","MakerWorld","Homebrew経由のインストール","CLIツール","パラメータカスタマイズ","視覚プレビュー"],"ko":["OpenSCAD 설치","3D 모델링 소프트웨어","STL 내보내기","3D 프린팅 플랫폼","MakerWorld","Homebrew를 통한 설치","CLI 도구","파라미터 커스터마이징","시각적预览"],"es":["OpenSCAD","modelado 3D","agentes de IA","Claude","impresión 3D","STL","MakerWorld","Homebrew","personalización de parámetros","previsualización de modelos"],"fr":["OpenSCAD","modélisation 3D","outils d''IA","Claude","impression 3D","STL","MakerWorld","Homebrew","personnalisation de paramètres","prévisualisation de modèles"],"de":["OpenSCAD","3D-Modellierung","KI-Agents","Claude","3D-Druck","STL","MakerWorld","Homebrew","Parameternanpassung","Modellvorschau"],"pt":["OpenSCAD","modelos 3D","pré-visualização","exportação STL","impressão 3D","MakerWorld","comandos Bash","ferramentas de AI","linguagem de programação 3D"],"ru":["OpenSCAD","3D-модели","предварительный просмотр","экспорт STL","3D-печать","MakerWorld","команды Bash","ИИ Агенты","язык программирования 3D"],"ar":["OpenSCAD","نماذج 3D","معاينة","تصدير STL","印刷 3D","MakerWorld","أوامر Bash","عمليات ذكية","لغة برمجة 3D"]}},"owner":"mitsuhiko","repo":"agent-stuff","repoPath":"mitsuhiko/agent-stuff","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-08T01:57:15.283Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"openscad","description":"Create and render OpenSCAD 3D models. Generate preview images from multiple angles, extract customizable parameters, validate syntax, and export STL files for 3D printing platforms like MakerWorld.","bodyPreview":"# OpenSCAD Skill\n\nCreate, validate, and export OpenSCAD 3D models. Supports parameter customization, visual preview from multiple angles, and STL export for 3D printing platforms like MakerWorld.\n\n## Prerequisites\n\nOpenSCAD must be installed. Install via Homebrew:\n```bash\nbrew install openscad\n```\n\n## Tools\n\nThis skill provides several tools in the `tools/` directory:\n\n### Preview Generation\n```bash\n# Generate a single preview image\n./tools/preview.sh model.scad output.png [--camera=x,y,z,tx,ty,","body":"# OpenSCAD Skill\n\nCreate, validate, and export OpenSCAD 3D models. Supports parameter customization, visual preview from multiple angles, and STL export for 3D printing platforms like MakerWorld.\n\n## Prerequisites\n\nOpenSCAD must be installed. Install via Homebrew:\n```bash\nbrew install openscad\n```\n\n## Tools\n\nThis skill provides several tools in the `tools/` directory:\n\n### Preview Generation\n```bash\n# Generate a single preview image\n./tools/preview.sh model.scad output.png [--camera=x,y,z,tx,ty,tz,dist] [--size=800x600]\n\n# Generate multi-angle preview (front, back, left, right, top, iso)\n./tools/multi-preview.sh model.scad output_dir/\n```\n\n### STL Export\n```bash\n# Export to STL for 3D printing\n./tools/export-stl.sh model.scad output.stl [-D ''param=value'']\n```\n\n### Parameter Extraction\n```bash\n# Extract customizable parameters from an OpenSCAD file\n./tools/extract-params.sh model.scad\n```\n\n### Validation\n```bash\n# Check for syntax errors and warnings\n./tools/validate.sh model.scad\n```\n\n## Visual Validation (Required)\n\n**Always validate your OpenSCAD models visually after creating or modifying them.**\n\nAfter writing or editing any OpenSCAD file:\n\n1. **Generate multi-angle previews** using `multi-preview.sh`\n2. **View each generated image** using the `read` tool\n3. **Check for issues** from multiple perspectives:\n   - Front/back: Verify symmetry, features, and proportions\n   - Left/right: Check depth and side profiles\n   - Top: Ensure top features are correct\n   - Isometric: Overall shape validation\n4. **Iterate if needed**: If something looks wrong, fix the code and re-validate\n\nThis catches issues that syntax validation alone cannot detect:\n- Inverted normals or inside-out geometry\n- Misaligned features or incorrect boolean operations\n- Proportions that don''t match the intended design\n- Missing or floating geometry\n- Z-fighting or overlapping surfaces\n\n**Never deliver an OpenSCAD model without visually confirming it looks correct from multiple angles.**\n\n## Workflow\n\n### 1. Creating an OpenSCAD Model\n\nWrite OpenSCAD code with customizable parameters at the top:\n\n```openscad\n// Customizable parameters\nwall_thickness = 2;        // [1:0.5:5] Wall thickness in mm\nwidth = 50;                // [20:100] Width in mm\nheight = 30;               // [10:80] Height in mm\nrounded = true;            // Add rounded corners\n\n// Model code below\nmodule main_shape() {\n    if (rounded) {\n        minkowski() {\n            cube([width - 4, width - 4, height - 2]);\n            sphere(r = 2);\n        }\n    } else {\n        cube([width, width, height]);\n    }\n}\n\ndifference() {\n    main_shape();\n    translate([wall_thickness, wall_thickness, wall_thickness])\n        scale([1 - 2*wall_thickness/width, 1 - 2*wall_thickness/width, 1])\n        main_shape();\n}\n```\n\nParameter comment format:\n- `// [min:max]` - numeric range\n- `// [min:step:max]` - numeric range with step\n- `// [opt1, opt2, opt3]` - dropdown options\n- `// Description text` - plain description\n\n### 2. Validate the Model\n```bash\n./tools/validate.sh model.scad\n```\n\n### 3. Generate Previews\n\nGenerate preview images to visually validate the model:\n```bash\n./tools/multi-preview.sh model.scad ./previews/\n```\n\nThis creates PNG images from multiple angles. Use the `read` tool to view them.\n\n### 4. Export to STL\n```bash\n./tools/export-stl.sh model.scad output.stl\n# With custom parameters:\n./tools/export-stl.sh model.scad output.stl -D ''width=60'' -D ''height=40''\n```\n\n## Camera Positions\n\nCommon camera angles for previews:\n- **Isometric**: `--camera=0,0,0,45,0,45,200`\n- **Front**: `--camera=0,0,0,90,0,0,200`\n- **Top**: `--camera=0,0,0,0,0,0,200`\n- **Right**: `--camera=0,0,0,90,0,90,200`\n\nFormat: `x,y,z,rotx,roty,rotz,distance`\n\n## MakerWorld Publishing\n\nFor MakerWorld, you typically need:\n1. STL file(s) exported via `export-stl.sh`\n2. Preview images (at least one good isometric view)\n3. A description of customizable parameters\n\nConsider creating a `model.json` with metadata:\n```json\n{\n  \"name\": \"Model Name\",\n  \"description\": \"Description for MakerWorld\",\n  \"parameters\": [...],\n  \"tags\": [\"functional\", \"container\", \"organizer\"]\n}\n```\n\n## Example: Full Workflow\n\n```bash\n# 1. Create the model (write .scad file)\n\n# 2. Validate syntax\n./tools/validate.sh box.scad\n\n# 3. Generate multi-angle previews\n./tools/multi-preview.sh box.scad ./previews/\n\n# 4. IMPORTANT: View and validate ALL preview images\n#    Use the read tool on each PNG file to visually inspect:\n#    - previews/box_front.png\n#    - previews/box_back.png\n#    - previews/box_left.png\n#    - previews/box_right.png\n#    - previews/box_top.png\n#    - previews/box_iso.png\n#    Look for geometry issues, misalignments, or unexpected results.\n#    If anything looks wrong, go back to step 1 and fix it!\n\n# 5. Extract and review parameters\n./tools/extract-params.sh box.scad\n\n# 6. Export STL with default parameters\n./tools/export-stl.sh box.scad box.stl\n\n# 7. Export STL with custom parameters\n./tools/export-stl.sh box.scad box_large.stl -D ''width=80'' -D ''height=60''\n```\n\n**Remember**: Never skip the visual validation step. Many issues (wrong dimensions, boolean operation errors, inverted geometry) are only visible when you actually look at the rendered model.\n\n## OpenSCAD Quick Reference\n\n### Basic Shapes\n```openscad\ncube([x, y, z]);\nsphere(r = radius);\ncylinder(h = height, r = radius);\ncylinder(h = height, r1 = bottom_r, r2 = top_r);  // cone\n```\n\n### Transformations\n```openscad\ntranslate([x, y, z]) object();\nrotate([rx, ry, rz]) object();\nscale([sx, sy, sz]) object();\nmirror([x, y, z]) object();\n```\n\n### Boolean Operations\n```openscad\nunion() { a(); b(); }        // combine\ndifference() { a(); b(); }   // subtract b from a\nintersection() { a(); b(); } // overlap only\n```\n\n### Advanced\n```openscad\nlinear_extrude(height) 2d_shape();\nrotate_extrude() 2d_shape();\nhull() { objects(); }        // convex hull\nminkowski() { a(); b(); }    // minkowski sum (rounding)\n```\n\n### 2D Shapes\n```openscad\ncircle(r = radius);\nsquare([x, y]);\npolygon(points = [[x1,y1], [x2,y2], ...]);\ntext(\"string\", size = 10);\n```\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-08T02:00:52.924Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for 3D Modeling Agents needing customizable and visualizable 3D models with STL export capabilities.","zh":"适合需要可定制和可视化的 3D 模型以及 STL 导出功能的 3D 建模代理。","ja":"カスタマイズ可能で視覚化可能な 3D モデルおよび STL エクスポート機能を必要とする 3D モデリング エージェントに最適です。","ko":"사용자 지정 가능하며 시각화 가능한 3D 모델 및 STL 내보내기 기능이 필요한 3D 모델링 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de modelado 3D que necesitan modelos 3D personalizables y visualizables con capacidades de exportación STL.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de modélisation 3D nécessitant des modèles 3D personnalisables et visualisables avec des capacités d''exportation STL.","de":"Perfekt für 3D-Modellierungsagenten, die benutzerdefinierbare und visualisierbare 3D-Modelle mit STL-Exportfunktionen benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Modelagem 3D que necessitam de modelos 3D personalizáveis e visualizáveis com capacidades de exportação STL.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов 3D-моделирования, которым необходимы настраиваемые и визуализируемые 3D-модели с возможностью экспорта STL.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء النموذجية 3D الذين يحتاجون إلى نماذج 3D قابلة للتخصيص والتصوير مع إمكانيات تصدير STL."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to create, validate, and export OpenSCAD 3D models with parameter customization, supporting visual preview from multiple angles and STL export for 3D printing platforms like MakerWorld, utilizing Homebrew for installation.","zh":"使代理能够创建、验证和导出带有参数自定义的 OpenSCAD 3D 模型，支持从多个角度进行视觉预览，并为 3D 打印平台（如 MakerWorld）导出 STL 文件，利用 Homebrew 进行安装。","ja":"エージェントがパラメータ化されたデザインで OpenSCAD 3D モデルを作成、検証、エクスポートできるようにし、複数の角度からの視覚的なプレビューをサポートし、MakerWorld のような 3D プリント プラットフォーム向けに STL ファイルをエクスポートし、Homebrew を使用してインストールします。","ko":"에이전트가 매개 변수화된 디자인으로 OpenSCAD 3D 모델을 생성, 검증 및 내보내기 할 수 있도록 하는 동시에 다중 각도에서 시각적 미리 보기를 지원하고 MakerWorld와 같은 3D 프린팅 플랫폼을 위해 STL 파일을 내보내며 Homebrew를 사용하여 설치합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a crear, validar y exportar modelos 3D de OpenSCAD con personalización de parámetros, que admiten la vista previa visual desde múltiples ángulos y la exportación STL para plataformas de impresión 3D como MakerWorld, utilizando Homebrew para la instalación.","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer, de valider et d''exporter des modèles 3D OpenSCAD avec personnalisation de paramètres, prenant en charge l''aperçu visuel sous plusieurs angles et l''exportation STL pour les plateformes d''impression 3D comme MakerWorld, en utilisant Homebrew pour l''installation.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, OpenSCAD-3D-Modelle mit Parameteranpassung zu erstellen, zu überprüfen und zu exportieren, mit Unterstützung für visuelle Vorschau aus mehreren Winkeln und STL-Export für 3D-Druckplattformen wie MakerWorld, wobei Homebrew für die Installation verwendet wird.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a criar, validar e exportar modelos 3D OpenSCAD com personalização de parâmetros, suportando pré-visualização visual de múltiplos ângulos e exportação STL para plataformas de impressão 3D como MakerWorld, utilizando Homebrew para instalação.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью создавать, проверять и экспортировать 3D-модели OpenSCAD с настраиваемыми параметрами, поддерживая визуальный просмотр с нескольких углов и экспорт STL для платформ 3D-печати như MakerWorld, используя Homebrew для установки.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على إنشاء وتحقق وتصدير نماذج 3D OpenSCAD مع تخصيص المعلمات، ودعم معاينة بصرية من زوايا متعددة وتصدير STL منصات الطباعة 3D مثل MakerWorld، باستخدام Homebrew للتثبيت."},"useCases":{"en":["Generating 3D model previews from SCAD files","Customizing 3D models with parameterized designs","Exporting STL files for 3D printing"],"zh":["从 SCAD 文件生成 3D 模型预览","使用参数化设计自定义 3D 模型","导出 STL 文件用于 3D 打印"],"ja":["SCAD ファイルから 3D モデル プレビューを生成する","パラメータ化されたデザインを使用して 3D モデルをカスタマイズする","3D プリント用に STL ファイルをエクスポートする"],"ko":["SCAD 파일에서 3D 모델 미리 보기를 생성하는 것","매개 변수화된 디자인을 사용하여 3D 모델을 사용자 지정하는 것","3D 프린팅을 위한 STL 파일을 내보내는 것"],"es":["Generar vistas previas de modelos 3D a partir de archivos SCAD","Personalizar modelos 3D con diseños parametrizados","Exportar archivos STL para plataformas de impresión 3D"],"fr":["Générer des aperçus de modèles 3D à partir de fichiers SCAD","Personnaliser des modèles 3D avec des conceptions paramétrées","Exporter des fichiers STL pour les plateformes d''impression 3D"],"de":["Erstellen von 3D-Modellvorschauen aus SCAD-Dateien","Anpassen von 3D-Modellen mit parametrierten Entwürfen","Exportieren von STL-Dateien für 3D-Druckplattformen"],"pt":["Geração de visualizações de modelos 3D a partir de arquivos SCAD","Personalização de modelos 3D com designs parametrizados","Exportação de arquivos STL para plataformas de impressão 3D"],"ru":["Генерация предпросмотров 3D-моделей из файлов SCAD","Настройка 3D-моделей с параметризованными дизайнами","Экспорт файлов STL для платформ 3D-печати"],"ar":["توليد معاينات نموذجية 3D من ملفات SCAD","تخصيص نماذج 3D مع تصاميم معلمة","تصدير ملفات STL لمنصات الطباعة 3D"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires OpenSCAD installation via Homebrew","Limited to OpenSCAD file format (.scad)"],"zh":["需要通过 Homebrew 安装 OpenSCAD","仅限 OpenSCAD 文件格式 (.scad)"],"ja":["Homebrew を使用して OpenSCAD をインストールする必要がある","OpenSCAD ファイル形式 (.scad) のみをサポートする"],"ko":["Homebrew를 사용하여 OpenSCAD를 설치해야 함","OpenSCAD 파일 형식 (.scad)만을 지원함"],"es":["Requiere la instalación de OpenSCAD a través de Homebrew","Limitado al formato de archivo OpenSCAD (.scad)"],"fr":["Nécessite l''installation d''OpenSCAD via Homebrew","Limité au format de fichier OpenSCAD (.scad)"],"de":["Benötigt die Installation von OpenSCAD über Homebrew","Begrenzt auf das OpenSCAD-Dateiformat (.scad)"],"pt":["Requer instalação do OpenSCAD via Homebrew","Limitado ao formato de arquivo OpenSCAD (.scad)"],"ru":["Требует установки OpenSCAD через Homebrew","Ограничен форматом файла OpenSCAD (.scad)"],"ar":["يتطلب تثبيت OpenSCAD من خلال Homebrew","محدود بتنسيق ملف OpenSCAD (.scad)"]},"version":4},"contentHash":"e49b7c056c4f9cee67b6e3fa4620915ccdddf12278159db9073cc063ee957799","qualityScore":39}');
